{{Infobox NPC |name = Biles |image = [[File:Biles.png|120px]] |release = [[19 November]] [[2025]] |update = Sailing is OUT TODAY! |aka = Friedrich Henglebert |members = Yes |race = [[Human]] |location = [[Tear of the Soul]] |gender = Male |options = Talk-to |examine = A banknote exchange merchant who has taken on the role of king. |map = {{NPC map|x=2342|y=2762|r=3|mtype=square}} |id = 15393 |leagueRegion = No }} [[File:Biles chathead.png|left]] '''Biles''' (real name '''Friedrich Henglebert'''{{CiteNPC|npc=Biles|quote=I should get to name whatever I want, just like Sleve does. He gets to name everything. He even named me! Before all this, my name was Friedrich Henglebert!}}) is the self-proclaimed king of the Drumstick Kingdom, located on the [[Tear of the Soul]]. He resides on the south-eastern part of the island, next to 3 yew trees. In order to access him, one needs 61 [[Sailing]].
A [[bank note]] can be used on him to be un-noted in exchange for 5 coins.
==Dialogue== {{Hastranscript|npc}}
==Trivia== * According to [[Mod Lenny]], Biles was added solely to un-note [[Cider]] to be used by [[Sleve McDichael]], as otherwise it would be a long trip for any players that wanted to try more than 28 new [[boat name]]s. {{fact}}
==References== {{Reflist}}
{{Tear of the Soul}}

{{Gone|update=Eating in the Bank}} {{Infobox NPC |version1 = Protesting |version2 = Happy |name = Bill |image1 = [[File:Bill.png|120px]] |image2 = [[File:Bill (happy).png|120px]] |release = [[11 December]] [[2019]] |update = Christmas 2019 |removal = [[9 January]] [[2020]] |removalupdate = Eating in the Bank |members = No |race = [[Human]] |location = [[Varrock]] |gender = Male |examine1 = He looks upset about something |examine2 = He can barely contain his joy. |map = No |id1 = hist3081 |id2 = hist3082 |leagueRegion = No }} [[File:Bill chathead.png|left]] '''Bill''' was one of the children protesting in [[Varrock Square]] during the [[2019 Christmas event]]. After the player completed the event, he could be found happily jumping around, waiting for the delivery of [[Gingerbread gnome]]s.
