{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Red |version2 = Blue |version3 = Green |name = Bird's egg |image1 = [[File:Bird's egg (red).png]] |image2 = [[File:Bird's egg (blue).png]] |image3 = [[File:Bird's egg (green).png]] |release = [[6 June]] [[2005]] |update = Seeds, Bankspace And Advisors |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine1 = A red bird's egg. |examine2 = A blue bird's egg. |examine3 = A green bird's egg. |value = 1 |weight = 0.002 |id1 = 5076 |id2 = 5077 |id3 = 5078 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Bird's egg (red) detail.png|left|120px]] |version2 = [[File:Bird's egg (blue) detail.png|left|120px]] |version3 = [[File:Bird's egg (green) detail.png|left|120px]] }} A '''bird's egg''' can be obtained from [[bird nest (egg)|egg bird nests]] which come from various sources, such as falling out of a tree while [[Woodcutting]] or as loot from [[Bird house trapping]]. They can come in three different colours: green, blue, and red which represent the colours of [[Guthix]], [[Saradomin]], and [[Zamorak]], respectively.
These eggs can be offered to the [[shrine]] in the [[Woodcutting Guild]] to receive 100 [[Prayer]] [[experience]] and a [[bird nest]] with seeds or a piece of the [[evil chicken outfit]] as a reward. Each piece of the evil chicken outfit has a 1/1200 chance of being awarded, resulting in approximately a 1/300 chance of receiving any outfit piece.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1259915895343890434|date=11 May 2020|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/105367|archivedate=24 Aug 2020|quote=The head is 1/1200. The wings are 1/1200. The legs are 1/1200. The feet are 1/1200. Thus the chance of getting an outfit piece is 1/300.}} Any outfit piece will replace a nest, so a full inventory will not compromise receiving the outfit piece.
Considering the value of the nest with seeds from the shrine, the value of all pieces of the evil chicken outfit, and the chance of obtaining one of these pieces, the average value of one egg is {{Coins|floor((({{GEP|Evil chicken head}} + {{GEP|Evil chicken wings}} + {{GEP|Evil chicken legs}} + {{GEP|Evil chicken feet}}) / 1200) + {{Average drop value|mob=Bird nest (seeds)|mobname=Seed nest|killname=search|raw=y}})}}.
The chances of getting a bird nest from a tree is 1/256 each time a player would normally get a log (except the [[blisterwood tree]] and [[redwood tree]], which do not drop bird nests other than clue nests). When a player receives a nest, the chance of the nest containing a bird's egg is 3/100 (each colour egg being 1/100). When wearing a [[strung rabbit foot]] the chances are increased slightly to 3/95{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1055815273763217414|date=26 October 2018|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/102252|archivedate=26 May 2020|quote=If you've got the rabbit foot necklace, pick number 0-94 inclusive. Otherwise, pick number 0-99 inclusive. 0 = red egg, 1 = blue egg, 2 = green egg, 3-34 = ring, otherwise it's seeds.}} by decreasing the chance of getting seeds.
