{{Infobox Scenery |name = Bird bath |image = [[File:Bird bath.png|200px]] |release = [[20 March]] [[2024]] |update = Varlamore: Part One |members = Yes |quest = No |location = West of [[Civitas illa Fortis]] |options = Drink-from |examine = A pool of fresh water. |map = {{Map|1555,3170|x:1713,y:3086|mtype=pin|ptype=object|caption=Bird Bath Locations}} |id = 52394 |leagueRegion = varlamore }}
Two '''bird baths''' can be found within [[Varlamore]]: one outside the entrance to the temple west of [[Civitas illa Fortis]], north of [[Ortus Farm]], and the other within the city itself, outside the east entrance to the temple south of the [[Bazaar]].
The player has the option to drink from the bird bath. Doing so has a chance to damage the player for 1 [[Hitpoints|Hitpoint]], [[poison]] them (with 2 severity), boost their [[Defence]] by 2, or do nothing.
==Dialogue== {{hastranscript|scenery}}
== Trivia == * Attempting to use a vessel that can normally be filled with water (such as a [[bowl]], [[jug]], [[bucket]], or [[vial]]) on the bird bath returns a unique message: "There really isn't enough water in here to do that." [[Category:Defence boosting items]]

{{External|rs|rsc}} {{Confuse|Quetzal feed}} {{Infobox Item |name = Bird feed |image = [[File:Bird feed.png]] |release = [[23 October]] [[2002]] |update = Updates galore! |members = Yes |quest = [[Biohazard]] |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Throw, Drop |examine = Birds love this stuff! |value = 1 |weight = 0.050 |id = 422 }} [[File:Bird feed detail.png|left|140px]] '''Bird feed''' is a [[quest items|quest item]] used only in [[Biohazard]]. It is found by searching the [[cupboard (Jerico's house)|cupboard]] in [[Jerico]]'s house, immediately south of the northern bank in [[East Ardougne]].
It is thrown onto the watchtower fence to cause a distraction by releasing the pigeons from the [[pigeon cage]], in order for the player to climb the rope ladder near [[Omart]] to access [[West Ardougne]].
Duplicates can be [[drop trick]]ed by searching the cupboard to acquire another. However, throwing one bird feed at the watchtower will delete additional copies, and the player will no longer be able to acquire any more bird feed.
