'''Bird feeders''' are used during the [[Eagles' Peak]] [[quest]]. When [[odd bird seed]] is used on the feeder, this will move the [[metal bird]]s, which is necessary to obtain the [[Golden feather (Eagles' Peak)|golden feather]]. The golden feather is used to open the [[Stone door (Eagles' Peak)|stone door]] where [[Nickolaus]] is held captive.
When a player gets stuck on the puzzle, they can use the [[Reset Lever]] to reset the entire puzzle.
