An empty '''bird nest''' is the result of emptying a [[bird nest]] with seeds, rings, or eggs. Empty nests can be crushed with a [[pestle and mortar]] to get a [[crushed nest]], which is used in [[Herblore]] to create [[Saradomin brews]]. Bird nests are only tradeable when empty or crushed. [[Wesley]] in [[Nardah]] will crush both noted and un-noted bird nests for a fee of 50 [[coins]] each.

Some activities can directly award empty nests. In [[bird house trapping]], up to 10 nest rolls are performed with a chance of getting an empty nest. For successful rolls, the chance is 65/100 for an empty nest. Wearing a [[strung rabbit foot]] removes 5 empty nest slots, making the chance 60/95, and improving the chance of getting [[Bird nest (ring)|ring]] or [[Bird nest (egg)|egg]] nests instead.

[[Wyson]] occasionally rewards empty nests when trading in [[mole claw]]s and [[mole skin]]s. If the player's inventory is too full to hold the nests, he may instead reward a [[nest box]] containing empty nests.

