The '''Bitternut Tree''' is a type of tree that can be found inside the [[Trouble Brewing]] [[minigame]]. It cannot be chopped down. 

Players can use [[red monkey]]s and [[blue monkey]]s on the tree to get them to collect [[bitternut]]s from the tree and throw them to the player.

A monkey cannot hit a brewer with a bitternut if they are further than 8 tiles removed from the bitternut tree, forming a 17x17 square pelting area centered on the tree's south-western tile.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1172097743877279744|date=12 September 2019|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20190928025904/https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1172097743877279744|archivedate=28 September 2019|quote=Are you 9+ tiles away from the tree when it fails to do this? It's checking to see if you're "too far away". (...)}}
