The '''Black Arm Gang''' is a gang at war with the [[Phoenix Gang]]. Their [[Black Arm Gang Headquarters|headquarters]] is situated in the south-west of [[Varrock]], near the city's southern entrance. The Black Arm Gang operates under the front of a financial advice company.{{CiteNPC|npc=Katrine|quote=A small, family business. We give financial advice to other companies.}}

According to the Phoenix Gang leader, [[Straven]], the Black Arm Gang was formed when some Phoenix Gang members mutinied and branched off into a separate gang.{{CiteNPC|npc=Straven|loc=Shield of Arrav|quote=After the fight, some gang members split off and formed their own group.}} They broke the [[broken shield|Shield of Arrav]] in two during the process, taking the right half with them.{{CiteNPC|npc=Straven|loc=Shield of Arrav|quote=A few years ago there was a big fight within the gang and the shield got broken in half as a result.}}

During the events of the [[Shield of Arrav]] [[quest]], players can choose the Black Arm Gang or the Phoenix Gang in an attempt to retrieve both halves of the shield at the request of [[Reldo]].

During [[Heroes' Quest]], players seeking the [[thieves' armband]] must steal [[Scarface Pete]]'s [[Pete's candlestick|candlestick]] for [[Katrine]].

==Members==
*[[Katrine]] (leader)
*[[Grubor]]
*[[Trobert]]
*Various [[Thief#Varrock Gang, 1|thieves]]

