|type = building
|leagueRegion = Misthalin
}}
The '''Black Arm Gang Headquarters''' is located in the south-western part of [[Varrock]], near the southern entrance to to city. The building is the headquarters for the ruthless and notorious [[Black Arm Gang]]. It is inhabited by three [[thief|thieves]], and [[Katrine|Katrine Raven]], the leader of the Black Arm Gang. The first two rooms are accessible by any player, however the back room and upstairs are locked for anyone who isn't a Black Arm Gang member.

Players must visit the location to speak to Katrine during the [[Shield of Arrav]] [[quest]] if they wish to join the Black Arm Gang. During the quest, players who are part of the Black Arm Gang must search the [[cupboard (Shield of Arrav)|cupboard]] located upstairs to retrieve the right half of the [[broken shield#Right|Shield of Arrav]]. 

During [[Heroes' Quest]], players of the Black Arm Gang will return to speak in Katrine to attempt to obtain the [[thieves' armband|master thieves' armband]], and will receive instruction to meet up with other Black Arm Gang members at their hideout in [[Brimhaven]].

