'''Black Guards''' are members of the [[Dwarven Black Guard]] found throughout areas controlled by the [[Dwarven Realm]], though the black guard in [[Keldagrim]] can be spoken to. They give [[Slayer]] [[experience]] if players are [[Slayer task|assigned]] to kill [[Dwarf|dwarves]]. They wield [[black warhammer]]s, however the black guard in Keldagrim attack with them much faster than a normal [[warhammer]].

