{{Black Knights' Fortress}}

{{External|rsc|rs=Black Knights' Fortress}} {{Infobox Location |name = Black Knights' Fortress |image = [[File:Black Knights' Fortress (location).png|300px]] |release = [[6 April]] [[2001]] |update = Massive update! |members = No |location = [[Asgarnia]] |map = {{Map|name=Black Knights' Fortress (location)|width=300|height=200|x=3020|y=3514}} |type = building |leagueRegion = Asgarnia }}
{{Otheruses|def=no|the base in the Taverley dungeon|Black Knights' Base}}
The '''Black Knights' Fortress''' is a castle of the [[Zamorakian]] military order of the [[Kinshra]], commonly referred to as the [[Black Knight|black knights]]. It plays a central role in the eponymous [[Black Knights' Fortress]] [[quest]], and is also visited during the [[King's Ransom]] and [[While Guthix Sleeps]] quests.
Players attempting to enter the fortress normally will be stopped from doing so by one of the [[Fortress Guard|fortress guards]]. In order to infiltrate the fortress, the player must be wearing one of the following combinations of armour: *A [[bronze med helm]] and an [[iron chainbody]] *A [[black full helm]], [[black platebody]], and [[black platelegs]]/[[black plateskirt]] **[[Black trimmed armour]] and [[Black gold-trimmed armour]] work, as well. *A set of [[elite black armour]] *The [[Dark Squall robes]]
The interior and surrounding areas contain level 20 fortress guards and level 33 black knights. Unlike the guards, the knights are [[Aggressiveness|aggressive]] and will automatically attack lower-levelled players. The black knights in the meeting room with the large table will always be aggressive to players entering the room and disturbing their meeting.
An [[altar]] to Zamorak can be found on the {{FloorNumber|uk=1}}. [[File:Black Knights' Fortress hall.png|thumb|left|The meeting hall and the witch's personal chamber.]]
==Transportation== The Black Knights' Fortress can be reached a number of ways: * Using the [[Arceuus spellbook]] spell [[Mind Altar Teleport]] and heading east. * Using the [[Ancient Magicks]] spell [[Lassar Teleport]] and heading north. * Using the [[standard spellbook]] spell [[Falador Teleport]] and heading north. * Using the [[Construct. cape|Construction skillcape]] or [[Taverley teleport|Taverley teleport tablet]] to teleport to [[Taverley]] and heading east. * Using the [[combat bracelet]] teleport to the [[Edgeville Monastery]] and heading around [[Ice Mountain]].
{{Relativelocation |location = Black Knights' Fortress |north = Wilderness |west = Goblin Village |south = Ice Mountain |east = Edgeville }}
