{{External|rs=Volatile chinchompa}} {{otheruses|the Hunter creature|the explosive Ranged weapon|Black chinchompa}} {{Infobox Monster |name = Black chinchompa |image = [[File:Black chinchompa (Hunter).png|280px]] |release = [[27 March]] [[2014]] |update = Wilderness Feedback Update |members = Yes |combat = 2 |size = |examine = Volatile and dangerous, yet so cute. |xpbonus = |max hit = 1 |aggressive = No |poisonous = No |attack style = [[Crush]] |attack speed = 4 |respawn = 7 |hitpoints = 1 |att = 2 |str = 2 |def = 2 |mage = 2 |range = 2 |attbns = 0 |strbns = 0 |amagic = 0 |mbns = 0 |arange = 0 |rngbns = 0 |dstab = 0 |dslash = 0 |dcrush = 0 |dmagic = 0 |dlight = 0 |dstandard = 0 |dheavy = 0 |poisonresistance = 0 |venomresistance = 0 |immunecannon = No |immunethrall = No |id = 2912 |leagueRegion = Wilderness }} The '''black chinchompa''' is a [[Chinchompa (race)|chinchompa]] that players can capture with the [[Hunter]] skill at level 73 or above and the completion of [[Eagles' Peak]], granting 315 Hunter [[experience]].
