==Hunting technique== The hunting technique is the same as for other chinchompas. Players must bring a [[box trap]] for each trap they plan to set up. Players can use the same box trap over and over to catch multiple creatures.
Black chinchompas can be attacked, but they will explode upon being killed, harming the player if they are standing right next to it for 2 damage. Accidental misclicks may be avoided by wielding a [[bow]] with no [[arrows]] or adjusting NPC attack options to right-click attack only.
A fast but more attention-needing method of catching chinchompas is the "stand and shoot" method. The player should equip a bow and about 1000+ arrows and figure out where one chinchompa respawns by killing one and seeing where it appears. Once the player knows the exact location where a chinchompa respawns, they should surround the square with their box traps. Then, as the chinchompa appears, it will either enter a trap, or it will dismantle all traps and hop away. If the chinchompa dismantles the traps, the player should immediately kill it with an arrow and set the traps up again as fast as possible. In about three to four seconds, the chinchompa will respawn again, and the player may repeat the process of "standing and shooting" if necessary. This method has been tested to be more experience per hour than the traditional "set-up traps and wait" method, because the player can just make the chinchompa respawn and make it more likely to enter a trap rather than wait while it wanders around.
===Hunting chance=== The chance of success is approximately 148/255 beginning at level 73, and 228/255 at level 99.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/646649948738617344|date=23 September 2015|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/106333|archivedate=26 May 2020|quote=For greys, it's 6/255 at level 1 and 268/255 at level 99; interpolate between those. Red & blacks use -78-228 /255.}} Carnivorous and [[Black chinchompa (Hunter)|Black Chinchompas]] have the same catch rate. The approximate formula for the chance of a successful catch (P) given hunter level (L) is:
<math> P(L) = (\lfloor \frac{306 \times (L-1)}{98} \rfloor - 78) \div 255 </math>
{{Skilling success chart|label=Chinchompa catch chance|lowLevel=53 |label1=Grey|low1=6|high1=268|req1=53|color1=gray|image1=Chinchompa.png |label2=Red|low2=-78|high2=228|req2=63|color2=red|image2=Red chinchompa.png |label3=Black|low3=-78|high3=228|req3=73|color3=black|image3=Black chinchompa.png }}
As black chinchompas are located in the [[Wilderness]], there are chances of [[PKer]]s appearing. Therefore, it is recommended to bank the chinchompas every so often to avoid losing all of them to another player.
===Multiple traps=== Multiple box traps can be set at once depending on the player's Hunter level. As black chinchompas are caught in the [[Wilderness]], one extra trap may be set compared to hunting other chinchompas.
Box traps require the completion of the [[Eagles' Peak]] quest to place.
{| class="wikitable align-center-2 align-center-4" ! {{SCP|Hunter}} ! Traps |- | 73 || 5 |- | 80 || 6 |}
==Gallery== The following images display the precise spawn tiles of the chinchompas. The area is divided into three spots, each containing four chinchompa spawns. You may use these to optimize your trap placement. <gallery captionalign="center" widths="200"> Black chinchompa north spawns.png|Northern spawn tiles Black chinchompa centre spawns.png|Centre spawn tiles Black chinchompa south spawns.png|Southern spawn tiles </gallery>
== Baby Chinchompa Pet == When catching any chinchompa, you have a chance to obtain the [[Baby chinchompa]] skilling pet.
A player's actual chances of receiving it is , where is the base chance and is the player's Hunter level.
To find the pet chance for a method at a given level, refer to the [[Calculator:Skill pet chance|skill pet chance calculator]]. {| class="wikitable" !Chinchompa !Base chance !Chance at 99 |- |[[Chinchompa (Hunter)|Grey]] |131,395 |128,920 |- |[[Red chinchompa (Hunter)|Red]] |98,373 |95,898 |- |[[Black chinchompa (Hunter)|Black]] |82,758 |80,283 |}
