The '''black cog''' is a [[quest items|quest item]] used only in [[Clock Tower]]. It is found in a burning room in the [[Clock Tower (building)|Clock Tower]]'s basement, requiring a [[bucket of water]] in the inventory, or [[ice gloves]] or [[smiths gloves (i)]] equipped to pick up. 

It is used to repair the eastern [[Clock spindle (black)|black clock spindle]] in the basement.

Duplicates can be acquired by picking up another one after putting the first cog on the clock spindle and before completing the quest. Once the quest is completed, the cog can '''not''' be picked up from the spawn or if the duplicate is dropped.

