{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Black desert robe |image = [[File:Black desert robe.png]] |release = [[14 November]] [[2005]] |update = Shadow of the Storm |members = Yes |quest = [[Shadow of the Storm]] |tradeable = Yes |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Wear, Drop |examine = A desert robe stained black. |value = 30 |weight = 0.907 |exchange = Yes |id = 6752 }} [[File:Black desert robe detail.png|left|90px]] A '''black desert robe''' is an item of clothing that players may find useful when doing the [[Shadow of the Storm]] [[Quests|quest]]. They can make it by using [[black dye]] on a normal [[desert robe]]. This can also be done with a [[desert shirt]] to create a [[black desert shirt]].
The quest requires players to be wearing at least three black garments, in order to look evil. Players may already be wearing a set of desert robes (since the main part of the quest takes place in the [[Kharidian Desert]]), and [[black mushroom]]s can be found locally.
This makes it a convenient choice to make the ink and use it to dye the robes, though players will also need an empty [[vial]] and a [[pestle and mortar]] with them.
The black desert robes will '''not''' protect players from the [[desert heat]] effect. This is stated in a warning message shown when attempting to dye them.
