[[File:Black dragonhide detail.png|120px|left]]
'''Black dragonhide''' (also called '''Black d'hide''' by [[tanner]]s) is a 100% drop from [[black dragon]]s, [[brutal black dragon]]s, [[lava dragon]]s, and the [[King Black Dragon]]. The hide can be tanned to become [[black dragon leather]] by paying a [[tanner]] or by using the [[Tan Leather]] lunar spell. A tanner will charge 20 coins for each hide, or 45 in Canifis. Tanners can be found in [[Al Kharid]], the [[Ranging Guild]], [[Canifis]], the [[Crafting Guild]], [[Auburnvale]], and [[Forthos Dungeon]].

