[[File:Black d'hide armour equipped.png|thumb|120px|A player wearing black dragonhide armour.]]
'''Black dragonhide armour''' is a type of [[Ranged armour]]. All of the pieces require 70 [[Ranged]] to equip. Additionally, the body and shield require 40 [[Defence]] to equip. All of the pieces can be made through the [[Crafting]] skill from 6 pieces of [[black dragon leather]], or obtained as fairly common rewards from completing [[Hard clues]]. It has defence bonuses similar to [[Black equipment|black]] and [[Mithril equipment|mithril armour]], however does not have a negative [[magic defence]] bonus and has a considerably lighter weight.

[[Blessed dragonhide armour]] pieces have a +1 [[prayer bonus]] each.

