===Elite===
'''[[Elite black armour]]''' can obtained by killing [[Elite Black Knight]] during and after [[While Guthix Sleeps]]. It has slightly higher stats than regular black armour and—when the full set is equipped—will remove the aggressiveness of monsters inside the [[Black Knight Catacombs]].

It has the same prayer bonus as white [[proselyte armour]], but is defensively equivalent to [[mithril armour|mithril]] rather than [[adamant armour]].

It is not tradeable.

{{Infotable Bonuses|Elite black full helm|Elite black platebody|Elite black platelegs|sort=dslash|nototals=yes}}

