'''Black gold-trimmed wizard robes''' are a [[Wizard robes|black wizard robe set]] with a gold trim. The pieces are possible rewards from [[Clue scroll (easy)|easy]] [[Treasure Trails]]. This set has the same bonuses as their regular blue counterparts but is worn by players to show a form of wealth. Unlike the regular robes, they cannot be combined with [[Blue dye]] to try to create [[Blue gold-trimmed wizard robes]].

This set was released on the [[12 June|12th of June]], [[2014]] along with the [[Treasure Trail]] Expansion [[Update:Treasure Trail Expansion|update]].

