{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Black halberd |image = [[File:Black halberd.png]] |release = [[20 September]] [[2004]] |update = Plague City Part 4 Released |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Wield, Drop |examine = A black halberd. |value = 1920 |weight = 3.175 |exchange = Yes |id = 3196 }} [[File:Black halberd detail.png|left|150px]] The '''black halberd''' is a two-handed [[melee]] [[weapon]] that is [[members only]]. To wield one the player must have at least 10 [[Attack]] and 5 [[Strength]]. To obtain a black halberd either buy one at [[Quartermaster's Stores]] in [[Tyras Camp]] or from another player. Although completion of the [[Regicide]] quest is required in order to wield the [[dragon halberd]], it is not a requirement in order to wield any other halberds.
As with all [[Black equipment|black]] and [[white equipment]], the black halberd cannot be made from raw materials using the [[Smithing]] skill.
