[[File:Black key black detail.png|left|140px]]
'''Black key black''' is a key that is rewarded from the [[Shades of Mort'ton (minigame)|Shades of Mort'ton]] minigame. To obtain it, the player must kill a [[Riyl shade]] or [[Asyn shade]] and then burn its remains on a pyre. The key may be used to enter the [[Shade Catacombs]] and then open the correctly coloured chest. It will open a [[Black Chest (black)|black-framed chest with a black lock]]. This type of key can only open doors up to black within the tomb.

Unlike most items, this key will not despawn and cannot be taken by other players for 5 minutes when initially dropped from shade remains, similar to other keys from the Shades of Mort'ton minigame. When dropped by the player, they will despawn and become visible to others at the normal rate.

