{{external|rs=Black knight (Jacob Higgs)}} {{Otheruses|the black knight found in the [[Port Sarim jail]]|the common black knights|Black Knight}} {{Infobox Monster |name = Black knight |image = [[File:Black knight (Port Sarim jail).png|150px]] |release = [[26 September]] [[2005]] |update = New graphics for Port Sarim, Rimmington and Thurgo's Peninsula |members = No |combat = 33 |size = 1 |examine = A dark-hearted knight. |xpbonus = 0 |max hit = 4 |aggressive = Varies |poisonous = No |attack style = [[Slash]] |attack speed = 5 |respawn = 25 |hitpoints = 42 |att = 25 |str = 25 |def = 25 |mage = 1 |range = 1 |attbns = 18 |strbns = 16 |amagic = 0 |mbns = 0 |arange = 0 |rngbns = 0 |dstab = 73 |dslash = 76 |dcrush = 70 |dmagic = -11 |dlight = 72 |dstandard = 72 |dheavy = 72 |poisonresistance = 0 |venomresistance = 0 |immunecannon = No |immunethrall = No |id = 1545 }} A unique '''black knight''' can be found locked up in the [[Port Sarim jail|jail]] at [[Port Sarim]], which only drops [[bones]] when killed rather than the usual variety of items. The knight's cell cannot be entered, though the player can use [[Ranged]], [[Magic]], or long-distance [[melee]] weapons, such as [[halberd]]s, to attack him through the bars.
Unlike most [[Black Knight|black knights]], killing this one does not contribute the player's [[White_equipment#Knight_rankings|White Knight rank]].
