{{External|rs}} {{otheruses|the unimbued black mask|the imbued version|Black mask (i)}} {{Infobox Item |version1 = Uncharged |version2 = (1) |version3 = (2) |version4 = (3) |version5 = (4) |version6 = (5) |version7 = (6) |version8 = (7) |version9 = (8) |version10 = (9) |version11 = (10) |name1 = Black mask |name2 = Black mask (1) |name3 = Black mask (2) |name4 = Black mask (3) |name5 = Black mask (4) |name6 = Black mask (5) |name7 = Black mask (6) |name8 = Black mask (7) |name9 = Black mask (8) |name10 = Black mask (9) |name11 = Black mask (10) |image = [[File:Black mask.png]] |release = [[4 July]] [[2006]] |update = Trouble Brewing |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options1 = Wear, Drop |options2 = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |options3 = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |options4 = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |options5 = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |options6 = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |options7 = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |options8 = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |options9 = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |options10 = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |options11 = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |examine1 = An inert-seeming cave horror mask. |examine2 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine3 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine4 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine5 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine6 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine7 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine8 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine9 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine10 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine11 = A magic cave horror mask. |value = 3000 |weight = 10.000 |exchange1 = Yes |exchange2 = No |exchange3 = No |exchange4 = No |exchange5 = No |exchange6 = No |exchange7 = No |exchange8 = No |exchange9 = No |exchange10 = No |exchange11 = Yes |id1 = 8921 |id2 = 8919 |id3 = 8917 |id4 = 8915 |id5 = 8913 |id6 = 8911 |id7 = 8909 |id8 = 8907 |id9 = 8905 |id10 = 8903 |id11 = 8901 |leagueRegion = Morytania }} [[File:Black mask detail.png|left|130px]] [[File:Black mask chathead.png|left]] The '''black mask''' is a unique mask worn in the head slot. The mask has the same stats as a [[black med helm]]. It provides a player 16.67%{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/689105142382198784|date=18 January 2016|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/108599|archivedate=26 May 2020|quote=7/6.}} [[Attack]] and [[Strength]] boost against all monsters on the player's current [[Slayer task]]. It requires 20 Strength, 10 [[Defence]], and 40 [[Combat]] to equip.
The black mask is a rare drop from [[cave horror]]s. Killing them requires 58 [[Slayer]] and the completion of [[Cabin Fever]] to access the island they live on, [[Mos Le'Harmless]].
When charged, the mask has a passive ability to lower an attacking monster's Defence by 2 + 7% rounded down, using one charge in the process. In order for the mask to activate the following requirement must be met: * NPC must attack the player * NPC must be within 10 tiles * NPC must have 50% health or more. * NPC must not have reduced defence already.
There is a 1/10 chance to attempt triggering the effect.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1615381970497806340|date=17 January 2023|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/98720|archivedate=20 March 2023}} If it succeeds, then it rolls your magic accuracy vs the NPC's magic defence.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1270264880180985857|date=09 Jun 2020|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/104003|archivedate=28 Aug 2020|quote=If it does perform its attack, it'll use a charge. To perform it:- NPC must be within 10 tiles - NPC must have 50% health or more. - NPC must not have reduced defence already. Then it rolls your magic accuracy vs the NPC's magic defence.}} Once the mask has been drained of all 10 charges, there is no way to recharge it; however, the Attack and Strength boosts remain.
For 1,250,000 [[Nightmare Zone]] points or 625,000 with the [[Combat_Achievements/Hard|hard tier]] of [[Combat Achievements]], 500 [[Soul Wars]] [[Zeal Tokens]], or a [[Scroll of imbuing|Scroll of Imbuing]] purchased for 200 [[Emir's Arena|PvP Arena]] [[PvP Arena Rewards|points]], players can imbue a black mask, making it into a [[black mask (i)]], which provides a 15% [[Ranged]] and [[Magic]] accuracy and damage boost in addition to its melee boost. Imbuing a charged black mask gives an imbued version with the same number of charges, though the imbued version loses charges similarly to the unimbued mask.
Players with 55 [[Crafting]] (boostable) and who have unlocked the "Malevolent masquerade" ability from any Slayer master for 400 Slayer reward points can combine a black mask with other items of Slayer headgear to make a [[Slayer helmet]]. Note that this causes the mask to lose all of its charges.
Players with 53 [[Construction]] can use a black mask to upgrade their player-owned house's [[combat dummy]] into an [[undead combat dummy]] and improve their hit when using the [[ancient mace]] special attack to boost prayer points.
