(i).png]] |release = [[6 January]] [[2021]] |update = Soul Wars And 20th Anniversary Event |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |examine1 = An inert-seeming cave horror mask. |examine2 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine3 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine4 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine5 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine6 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine7 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine8 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine9 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine10 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine11 = A magic cave horror mask. |value = 3000 |weight = 10.000 |id1 = 25276 |id2 = 25275 |id3 = 25274 |id4 = 25273 |id5 = 25272 |id6 = 25271 |id7 = 25270 |id8 = 25269 |id9 = 25268 |id10 = 25267 |id11 = 25266 |leagueRegion = Morytania&Kandarin,Morytania&Misthalin }} |text3 = Emir's Arena |item3 = {{Infobox Item |version1 = Uncharged |version2 = (1) |version3 = (2) |version4 = (3) |version5 = (4) |version6 = (5) |version7 = (6) |version8 = (7) |version9 = (8) |version10 = (9) |version11 = (10) |name1 = Black mask (i) |name2 = Black mask (1) (i) |name3 = Black mask (2) (i) |name4 = Black mask (3) (i) |name5 = Black mask (4) (i) |name6 = Black mask (5) (i) |name7 = Black mask (6) (i) |name8 = Black mask (7) (i) |name9 = Black mask (8) (i) |name10 = Black mask (9) (i) |name11 = Black mask (10) (i) |image = [[File:Black mask (i).png]] |release = [[6 July]] [[2022]] |update = PvP Arena: Soft Launch |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wear, Uncharge, Drop |examine1 = An inert-seeming cave horror mask. |examine2 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine3 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine4 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine5 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine6 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine7 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine8 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine9 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine10 = A magic cave horror mask. |examine11 = A magic cave horror mask. |value = 3000 |weight = 10.000 |id1 = 26781 |id2 = 26780 |id3 = 26779 |id4 = 26778 |id5 = 26777 |id6 = 26776 |id7 = 26775 |id8 = 26774 |id9 = 26773 |id10 = 26772 |id11 = 26771 |leagueRegion = Morytania&Kandarin,Morytania&Misthalin }} }} [[File:Black mask (i) detail.png|left|130px]] [[File:Black mask (i) chathead.png|left]] The '''black mask (i)''' is an upgraded version of the [[black mask]]. It requires 20 [[Strength]], 10 [[Defence]], and 40 [[Combat]] to equip. It can be imbued as a reward from the [[Nightmare Zone]], costing 1,250,000 reward points or 625,000 with the [[Combat_Achievements/Hard|hard tier]] of [[Combat Achievements]], at [[Soul Wars]] for 500 [[Zeal Tokens]], or by using a [[scroll of imbuing]] purchased from the [[Emir's Arena]]. The imbued black mask can also be used to create an [[Slayer helmet (i)|imbued Slayer helmet]].
This version of the black mask provides the original bonus:
*16.67%{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/689105142382198784|date=18 January 2016|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/108599|archivedate=26 May 2020|quote=7/6.}} bonus to [[Melee]] accuracy and [[Strength]] on Slayer targets.
Plus the addition of: *15% bonus to [[Ranged]] accuracy and Strength. *15% bonus to [[Magic]] accuracy '''and''' Magic damage. *Getting rid of the -3 Magic and -1 Ranged attack penalties from the regular black mask.
If lost on death in [[PvP]] situations, the mask will '''lose''' its imbued status, but the player will be reimbursed the [[Nightmare Zone points]], [[Zeal Tokens]] or [[Scroll of imbuing]] to imbue it again.
When this item is imbued at [[Nightmare Zone]] and subsequently uncharged, it will refund 100% of the cost. 1,250,000 reward points by default and 625,000 when the [[Combat_Achievements/Hard|hard tier]] of [[Combat Achievements]] are complete.
