{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Music |name = Black of Knight |number = 769 |file = [[File:Black of Knight.ogg]] |release = [[10 July]] [[2024]] |update = While Guthix Sleeps |members = Yes |location = [[Black Knight Catacombs]] |hint = This track unlocks during the While Guthix Sleeps quest. |quest = [[While Guthix Sleeps]] |duration = 03:04 |composer = Adam Bond |map = {{Map|4096,4672|4096,4864|4160,4864|4160,4672|plane=1|mapID=-1|zoom=1|mtype=polygon|bucket=yes|height=400}} |cacheid = 798 |sortname = Black of Knight |unlockdetail = Unlocked during the [[While Guthix Sleeps]] quest. The track plays throughout the [[Black Knight Catacombs]]. |tempo=180 BPM|signature=4/4}} '''Black of Knight''' is a [[music]] track that is unlocked during the [[While Guthix Sleeps]] quest. The track plays throughout the [[Black Knight Catacombs]].
==Trivia== * The track is a port of the [[rsw:Black of Knight|''RuneScape 3'' track of the same name]], which was released on [[rsw:Update:While Guthix Sleeps|26 November 2008]] (the original While Guthix Sleeps update). * The track's name is a play on the phrase "(in the) black of night" and the word "knight" referring to the [[Elite Black Knight]]s who reside in the Catacombs.
{{While Guthix Sleeps}} {{Music}}

