{{Infobox Item |name = Black pickaxe |image = [[File:Black pickaxe.png]] |release = [[12 June]] [[2014]] |update = Treasure Trail Expansion |members = No |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Wield, Drop |examine = Used for mining. |value = 145 |weight = 0.010 |exchange = Yes |id = 12297 |leagueRegion = General }} [[File:Black pickaxe detail.png|left|130px]] The '''black pickaxe''' is a [[pickaxe]] that mines on a 5-tick cycle, 1-tick faster than the [[steel pickaxe]] and the same speed as the [[mithril pickaxe]]. It is a possible reward from [[Clue scroll (beginner)|beginner]] and [[Clue scroll (easy)|easy]] [[Treasure Trails]]. {{Costume storage|treasure chest}}
Players need 10 [[Attack]] to wield the [[pickaxe]] and 11 [[Mining]] to mine with it.
It is the lightest pickaxe, making it the best for activities that require running, such as [[quest]]ing and training [[Runecraft]] through the [[Abyss]] or [[Dense essence mine|Dense Essence Mining]].
