The '''black salamander''' is a [[salamander]] that players can capture with the [[Hunter]] skill at level 67 or above, granting 319.2 Hunter [[experience]].

Captured [[black salamander]]s can be used a two handed weapon. It requires a level of 70 [[Ranged]], [[Magic]] and [[Attack]] to wield. To be operated, the black salamander requires its requisite fuel, [[harralander tar]].

