{{Infobox Item |name = Black skirt (g) |image = [[File:Black skirt (g).png]] |release = [[12 June]] [[2014]] |update = Treasure Trail Expansion |members = No |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Wear, Drop |examine = Leg covering favoured by women and wizards. With a colourful trim! |value = 2 |weight = 0.907 |exchange = Yes |id = 12445 |leagueRegion = General }} [[File:Black skirt (g) detail.png|left|120px]] The '''Black skirt (g)''' is obtainable by completing [[Clue scroll (easy)|easy]] [[Treasure Trails]], and is part of the [[black gold-trimmed wizard robes]]. It is purely cosmetic and has no stats.
It is often worn for its visual appeal, as well as the fact that it can be used as a status symbol for [[free players]] that cannot wear or afford the slightly more expensive decorative [[rune platelegs]] ([[guthix platelegs]], [[rune platelegs (g)]], etc).
Unlike the regular skirt, it cannot be combined with [[Blue dye]] to try to create a [[Blue skirt (g)]].
