{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Black spiky vambraces |image = [[File:Black spiky vambraces.png]] |release = [[21 November]] [[2006]] |update = HUNTER SKILL! |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Wear, Drop |examine = Vambraces made from 100% real dragonhide. Now with added spikiness. |value = 4320 |weight = 0.283 |exchange = Yes |id = 10085 }} [[File:Black spiky vambraces detail.png|left|130px]] '''Black spiky vambraces''' are [[black dragonhide vambraces]] with [[kebbit claws]] attached. The difference in stats between spiked and non-spiked vambraces is a bonus to strength of +2 and a slight increase in melee defence for the spiked ones.
Like the black dragonhide vambraces they are created from, this variant also requires 70 Ranged to be worn.
[[Kebbit claws]] can be gained using the [[Hunter]] skill or from trading another player.
