{{Infobox Item |name = Black staff of collection |image = [[File:Black staff of collection.png]] |release = [[29 January]] [[2025]] |update = Bounty Hunter Changes, Collection Log Updates & Emote Improvements |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wield, Create-book, Drop |wornoptions = Collection Log, Collections Overview, Create-book |examine = A staff of collection, black tier. |value = 15 |weight = 1.814 |id = 30603 }} [[File:Black staff of collection detail.png|left|130px]] The '''black staff of collection''' is an item obtained from [[the Collector]] in the [[Varrock Museum]], which requires having registered 700 [[collection log]] items. When equipped, it can be used to access the collection log and its overview interface.
The staff additionally has a "Create-book" option which produces a [[collection log (black)|black collection log]] that can be equipped in the [[off-hand slot]].
