{{External|rs=Toy horsey (black)}} {{Infobox Item |name = Black toy horsey |image = [[File:Black toy horsey.png]] |release = [[1 April]] [[2004]] |update = RuneScape chat improved! |members = No |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Play-with, Drop |examine = A black toy horse. |value = 100 |weight = 0.050 |exchange = Yes |id = 2524 }} [[File:Black toy horsey detail.png|left|140px]] '''Black toy horseys''' are items made as a joke by [[Jagex]], poking fun at the requests made by players to have horses. Toy horseys are obtainable from [[Diango]] for 150 coins, and come in 4 different colours: white, black, grey, and brown. They can also be made from a [[plank]] on any [[crafting table]] in a [[player-owned house]], which requires level 10 or higher [[Crafting]].
When you play with the horsey, an animation showing your character playing with it appears, and your character says {{overhead|shadow=yes|colour=yellow|Just say neigh to gambling!}}
[[File:Black toy horsey.gif|left|thumb|A player playing with a black toy horsey.|220px]]
