{{External|rs}} {{Otheruses|the hunter creature|the item of the same name|Black warlock (item)}} {{Infobox NPC |name = Black warlock |image = [[File:Black warlock.png|160px]] |release = [[21 November]] [[2006]] |update = HUNTER SKILL! |members = Yes |race = Butterfly |location = [[Feldip Hunter area]] |options = Catch |examine = A black warlock. The air seems to distort wherever it passes. |map = No |id = 5553 |leagueRegion = Kandarin,Kourend,Varlamore }} [[File:Black warlock icon.png|left]] The '''black warlock''' is a [[Butterfly (Hunter)|butterfly]] that players can capture with the [[Hunter]] skill at level 45, by using a [[butterfly net]] and a [[butterfly jar]]. Players with level 55 Hunter can catch black warlocks barehanded. Black warlocks may be assigned as a [[Hunters' Rumours|hunters' rumour task]] by [[Huntmaster Gilman (Novice)|Huntmaster Gilman]] or [[Guild Hunter Cervus (Adept)|Guild Hunter Cervus]]. You do not need a butterfly jar when catching them to receive the [[Black butterfly wing]].
Releasing a black warlock (or catching it without a jar) provides a [[temporary skill boost]] to [[Strength]] level by 4 + 15% of their Strength level (rounded down). [[Black warlock (item)|Captured black warlocks]] may be used in [[Multicombat area|multicombat areas]] to share the Strength boost with up to three nearby players, provided that they have [[Accept Aid]] toggled on.
==Effects== Strength boost is calculated with: <math>\lfloor StrengthLevel \times \frac{15}{100} \rfloor + 4</math>
{| class="wikitable" style="text-align:center" !{{SCP|Strength}} Level!!Boost!!{{SCP|Strength}} Level!!Boost!!{{SCP|Strength}} Level!!Boost |- |'''1-6'''||+4||'''34-39'''||+9||'''67-73'''||+14 |- |'''7-13'''||+5||'''40-46'''||+10||'''74-79'''||+15 |- |'''14-19'''||+6||'''47-53'''||+11||'''80-86'''||+16 |- |'''20-26'''||+7||'''54-59'''||+12||'''87-93'''||+17 |- |'''27-33'''||+8||'''60-66'''||+13||'''94-99'''||+18 |}
