==Hunting technique== The hunting technique is the same as for other [[Butterfly (Hunter)|butterflies]]. One jar is needed for each butterfly you wish to keep. All of these items are available for purchase in [[Hunter shops]].
For players that have 85 [[Farming]], there is a black warlock butterfly spawn behind the [[fruit tree patch]] in the [[Farming Guild]] that does not move, thus a player can continuously click in one spot to gain easy Hunter experience (roughly 35,000 experience per hour). Similarly, for players who have completed or sufficiently progressed [[Troubled Tortugans]], there are multiple black warlock spawns near the [[sand pit]] on [[the Great Conch]] that respawn after 4.2 seconds on fixed tiles (despite moving around), allowing continuous clicking on their spawn tiles for the same experience rate.
