{{External|rs=Black warlock jar}} {{otheruses|the item|the butterfly|Black warlock}} {{Infobox Item |name = Black warlock |image = [[File:Black warlock (item).png]] |release = [[21 November]] [[2006]] |update = HUNTER SKILL! |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Release, Drop |examine = There's a black warlock butterfly in here. |value = 70 |weight = 0.020 |exchange = Yes |gemwname = Black warlock (item) |id = 10014 }} [[File:Black warlock (item) detail.png|left|100px]] A '''black warlock''' is a [[members-only]] [[item]] that can be made by catching a [[black warlock]] whilst they have a [[butterfly jar]] in their [[inventory]]. This requires level 45 [[Hunter]] to do so with a [[butterfly net]] or a [[magic butterfly net]], or level 55 Hunter without, and gives 54 [[experience]] points. They can be found in the southern to middle part of the [[Feldip Hunter area]] and in the [[Farming Guild]]'s Advanced tier.
Once caught, players can right-click "Release" the filled butterfly jar to [[boost]] their [[Strength]] by 4 + 15% of their Strength level (rounded down). In a [[multi-combat zone]], the item may be used on another player to share the effect with them and up to three players within a 5x5 area of the target. Players must have [[Accept Aid]] toggled on to receive the boost. The empty butterfly jar will remain in the inventory after use.
With a [[pestle and mortar]], players can combine the butterfly with raw [[hunter meat]] to create [[Black warlock mix|black warlock mix (2)]].{{Clear|left}}
