The '''blackjack seller''' is a man in the town centre of [[Pollnivneach]] that sells [[blackjack]]s. He is just south of the kebab shop, north of the camel man. The blackjack seller is constantly having his products stolen by the [[street urchin]].

The completion of [[The Feud]] is required to access the blackjack seller and his shop. This quest can be started in [[Al Kharid]].

[[Ali Morrisane]] has a business proposal for him during the [[Rogue Trader]] miniquest. After the player convinces him, he will start shipping offensive and defensive [[blackjack]]s to [[Ali Morrisane]] in Al Kharid. He will also sell a [[willow blackjack]] to the player, at a price of 600 coins.

