The '''blade''' is an [[Agility]] obstacle found within the [[Brimhaven Agility Arena]]. It consists of a blade coming out of the floor and back down in a cycle. It is the only obstacle in the Agility Arena that requires players to time movement correctly, regardless of Agility level. Crossing the blade will not award any Agility experience.

Players can take damage when standing or walking on the same tile as the incoming blade, even at 99 Agility. The message {{Mes|You were hit by the saw blade!}} will be displayed if this occurs. The amount of damage is based on the player's current health, according to the formula below.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/707860724291411969|date=10 March 2016|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20200430184728/https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/707860724291411969|archivedate=30 April 2020|quote=[(...) while on the subject whats the math behind the damage the obstacles deal? it seems to decrease w/ hp] ((HP * 5) / 100) + 2}}

<math>\left\lfloor \frac{ \text{Hitpoints} \cdot 5}{100} \right\rfloor + 2</math>

