==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 5 March 2025 |update = Game Jam: Charges QoL |change = * Charging the blade now contributes to the amount of [[crystal shard]]s required to upgrade it to a [[Blade of saeldor (c)|corrupted blade of Saeldor]]. * The Blade of Saeldor supports a bank item option for changing charges. }} {{Subject changes |date = 14 August 2024 |update = Slayer Partners |change = The Blade of Saeldor now has its original sound again. }} {{Subject changes |date = 7 August 2024 |update = Poll 82 Changes |change = The weapon's attack sound was changed to that of firing a bow. }} {{Subject changes |date = 13 September 2023 |update = The Path of Glouphrie |poll = |change = The charged blade now has a right-click "Check" option whilst equipped. }} {{Subject changes |date = 11 May 2022 |update = Equipment Rebalance Tier Changes & Poll 76 |change = The blade of Saeldor now requires level 80 Attack to wield instead of level 75 Attack. }} {{Subject changes |date = 30 June 2021 |update = Phosani's Nightmare |change = The blade is no longer obtained from [[The Gauntlet]]; in its place, the [[enhanced crystal weapon seed]] is now dropped instead, and the blade is crafted from the seed. }} {{Subject changes |date = 8 April 2020 |update = Poll 70 Improvements |poll = Old School Content Poll 70: Game Improvements |change = The blade can now be made non-degradeable by bringing it and 1,000 crystal shards to a singing bowl. }} {{Subject changes |date = 22 August 2019 |update = Kill Death Ratios and Web Slashing |poll = Crystal kit charges, Elves and the Iorwerth Dungeon |change = The number of charges the Blade of Saeldor receives per crystal shard has been increased from 25 to 100, and the maximum charges possible has been increased from 2,500 to 20,000. }} {{Subject changes footer}}
==Trivia== *In {{WP|J.R.R. Tolkien}}'s constructed elvish language, {{WP|Sindarin}}, ''Saeldor'' means either "wise land" or "wise king". *In the [[Poll:Song of the Elves rewards|Song of the Elves rewards]] poll, the Blade of Saeldor was proposed to have a [[special attack]] called ''Saeldor's Strike'', which consumes 100% of the player's special attack energy and deals 50% additional damage, as well as knockback and stun the target like the [[dragon spear]]'s special attack does. It only received 70.5% votes in favour, 4.5% short of passing the poll. * In ''RuneScape 3'', the blade is available as a cosmetic weapon override.
