'''Blandebir''' is one of the many [[dwarves]] that inhabit the bustling dwarven metropolis of [[Keldagrim]]. A noted brewer, Blandebir is often the first stop for players seeking to learn the art of [[brewing]].

Blandebir can be found upstairs in The [[Laughing Miner]] Pub on the eastern side of Keldagrim, near the [[Consortium]] building. There, he assists players in their brewing by offering advice about how to brew. More importantly, though, he is one of only three NPCs that sell [[ale yeast]], a necessary ingredient in the brewing process. On a nearby table is a [[pot]], which can be used as a convenient portable container for ale yeast. He sells ale yeast for 25 coins.

