====Bar patterns====
Each bar has an optimal pattern to minimise the amount of running to the bank. Following these patterns you should never have to run back to the bank with ores, and never have to make a trip just to pick up bars. These patterns assume you have a [[coal bag]] and [[ice gloves]]. It is recommended to collect when returning from coal runs due the delay of smelting ('''Adamantite''' and '''Runite'''). 

