====Hourly rates====
All rates assume goldsmith gauntlets are worn when smelting gold, and include the expenditures of 36 doses of [[stamina potion]] and {{NoCoins|72,000|c}} per hour to use the Blast Furnace. Pure gold expects ~250 trips to the conveyor belt per hour, while hybrid patterns expect ~200 trips.

As an example, doing 1,000 trips of adamantite and gold would result in 1,299,130 experience and {{NoCoins|floor((({{GEP|Gold bar|26}} - {{GEP|Gold ore|26}}) * 2 + {{GEP|Adamantite bar|26}} - {{GEP|Adamantite ore|26}} - {{GEP|Coal|78}})/3 * 1000)|c}}, while 500 trips of gold followed by 500 trips of just adamantite would result in 1,039,925 experience and {{NoCoins|floor({{GEP|Gold bar|28}} - {{GEP|Gold ore|28}} + ({{GEP|Adamantite bar|27}} - {{GEP|Adamantite ore|27}} - {{GEP|Coal|27 * 3}}) * .5) * 500|c}}.

