{{Infobox Item |name = Bleached bones |image = [[File:Bleached bones.png]] |release = [[27 January]] [[2021]] |update = Shades of Mort'ton Rework |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Bury, Drop |examine = A worthy offering to a dark god. |value = 1 |weight = 0.500 |id = 25422 }} [[File:Bleached bones detail.png|left|120px]] '''Bleached bones''' are an untradeable drop from [[Undead Zealot]]s. They can be offered at the [[Altar of the Damned]] to recharge a player's prayer points to full like a regular altar.
