{{Infobox Item |version1 = Eagle |version2 = Fox |version3 = Buffalo |bucketname1 = (eagle) |bucketname2 = (fox) |bucketname3 = (buffalo) |name = Blessed bone statuette |image1 = [[File:Blessed bone statuette (eagle).png]] |image2 = [[File:Blessed bone statuette (fox).png]] |image3 = [[File:Blessed bone statuette (buffalo).png]] |release = [[20 March]] [[2024]] |update = Varlamore: Part One |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Break-down, Drop |examine = A statuette carved from the finest blessed bone. |value = 2000 |alchable = No |weight = 0.028 |id1 = 29338 |id2 = 29340 |id3 = 29342 }} {{Synced switch |version1 = [[File:Blessed bone statuette (eagle) detail.png|130px|left]] |version2 = [[File:Blessed bone statuette (fox) detail.png|130px|left]] |version3 = [[File:Blessed bone statuette (buffalo) detail.png|130px|left]] }} '''Blessed bone statuettes''' are items that may occasionally be obtained from [[stealing valuables]]. Though considered as contraband in [[Varlamore]], players may break them down with a [[chisel]] to obtain 125 [[blessed bone shards]] (similar to that of [[Blessed superior dragon bones]] at 121 blessed bone shards) and 5 [[Crafting]] experience.
