{{External|rs}}
'''Blessed dragonhide armour''' is [[Ranged armour]] that requires 70 [[Ranged]] and 40 [[Defence]] to equip the [[Blessed body|body]], [[Blessed coif|coif]], [[Blessed boots|boots]], and [[Blessed shield|shield]], while the [[blessed chaps|chaps]] and [[Blessed bracers|bracers]] only require 70 Ranged. This armour '''cannot''' be made using the [[Crafting]] [[skill]]; players can only obtain it from hard [[Treasure Trails]] or through purchase from other players. Each piece of blessed dragonhide armour has equal offensive stats and better defensive stats compared to its corresponding [[black dragonhide armour]] piece, plus a +1 [[Prayer]] bonus. Unlike black dragonhide armour, coif and boots are also available.

Blessed dragonhide armour is available in 6 variants, [[Guthix]], [[Saradomin]], [[Zamorak]], [[Armadyl]], [[Bandos]], and [[Zaros|Ancient]]. Every armour piece, except Guthix armour, counts as god-related protection for the corresponding god within the [[God Wars Dungeon]] and the [[Wilderness God Wars Dungeon]].

==Components and bonuses==
All the blessed dragonhide armours have the same stats.
{{Infotable Bonuses|Guthix coif|Guthix d'hide body|Guthix chaps|Guthix bracers|Guthix d'hide boots|Guthix d'hide shield}}

