{{Infobox Item |name = Blessed drake bones |image = [[File:Blessed drake bones.png]] |release = [[20 March]] [[2024]] |update = Varlamore: Part One |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Break-down, Drop |examine = Bones blessed at an exposed altar. |value = 160 |weight = 1.800 |id = 29366 }} [[File:Blessed drake bones detail.png|130px|left]] '''Blessed drake bones''' are the blessed form of [[drake bones]] obtained by using them on the [[exposed altar]] on the summit of [[Ralos' Rise]]. They are broken down with a [[chisel]] to obtain 67 [[blessed bone shards]] and 5 [[Crafting]] experience, which can then be sacrificed at the [[libation bowl]] at [[the Teomat]].
As each shard sacrificed gives 5 [[Prayer]] experience, each blessed bone gives 320 Prayer experience overall. If using a [[jug of blessed sunfire wine]] at the libation bowl instead of a regular [[jug of blessed wine]], this is increased to 6 Prayer experience per shard, or 384 Prayer experience per bone.
Players looking to bless bones in bulk may talk to [[Virilis]], found at the base of the exposed altar, to unnote any type of [[bones]] for a fee of 10 [[coins]] per bone.
==Creation== {{Recipe |skill1 = |skill1lvl = |skill1exp = |members = Yes |ticks = 0 |ticksnote = All bones are blessed at once. |facilities = Exposed altar |mat1 = Drake bones |output1 = Blessed drake bones |output1cost = No }}
==Products== {{Uses material list|Blessed drake bones}}
{{The Teomat}} [[Category:Bones]] [[Category:Blessed bones]]

