{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Blessed lamp |image = [[File:Blessed lamp.png]] |release = [[6 March]] [[2007]] |update = Great Brain Robbery |members = Yes |quest = [[Great Brain Robbery]] |tradeable = No |bankable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Pray-over, Destroy |destroy = If you drop this lamp it will be destroyed, and you will need to see Brother Tranquility for another. |examine = This will answer my prayers. |value = 1 |alchable = No |weight = 0.100 |id = 10889 }} [[File:Blessed lamp detail.png|left|180px]] The '''blessed lamp''' is a reward obtained by completing the [[Great Brain Robbery]] quest. It gives 5,000 [[experience]] in a chosen [[skill]] above level 30. Players may reclaim their blessed lamp from [[Brother Tranquility]] if they lose it before gaining the experience from it.
This lamp '''can''' be banked. It is also worth noting that if your inventory is full, the lamp will not be placed in the inventory.
{{The Great Brain Robbery}} {{Experience lamp}}

