{{External|rs}} {{redirect3|Bss|For the upgraded Saradomin's sword, see [[Saradomin's blessed sword]]. For the Vale Totems reward, see [[bow string spool]]}} {{Infobox Item |name = Blessed spirit shield |image = [[File:Blessed spirit shield.png]] |release = [[16 October]] [[2014]] |update = Corporeal Beast |aka = BSS |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Wield, Drop |examine = An ethereal shield that has been blessed with holy powers. |value = 1200000 |weight = 2.000 |exchange = Yes |id = 12831 }} [[File:Blessed spirit shield detail.png|left|120px]] The '''blessed spirit shield''' requires 70 [[Defence]] and 60 [[Prayer]] to wield. To make this shield, players must use a [[holy elixir]] with a normal [[spirit shield]], which requires 85 Prayer. Ironmen may note this level cannot be boosted as prayer boosts do not affect the base level. Once blessed, players may apply [[spirit sigil]]s to enhance the shield. Attaching a sigil onto the shield requires 90 Prayer and 85 [[Smithing]].
This shield's stats are comparable to the stats of the [[Arcane spirit shield|arcane]] and [[spectral spirit shield]]. It differs only in lacking the higher magic attack and defence stats of the enhanced shields. This shield is a good choice for any player using [[melee]] because of its substantial defence bonuses and prayer bonus. Its crush defence bonus is also one point higher than that of a completely charged [[Dragonfire shield]]. Players who use [[Magic]] or [[Ranged]] may also find this shield useful due to its lack of negative stats.
==Combat stats== {{Infobox Bonuses |astab = 0 |aslash = 0 |acrush = 0 |amagic = 0 |arange = 0 |dstab = +53 |dslash = +55 |dcrush = +73 |dmagic = +2 |drange = +52 |str = 0 |rstr = 0 |mdmg = 0 |prayer = +3 |slot = shield |image = [[File:Blessed spirit shield equipped.png|150px]] |altimage = [[File:Blessed spirit shield equipped female.png|150px]] }}
==Creation== {{Recipe |skill1 = Prayer |skill1lvl = 85 |skill1boostable = No |skill1exp = 0 |members = Yes |ticks = |mat1 = Spirit shield |mat2 = Holy elixir |output1 = Blessed spirit shield }}
