==Changes== {{Subject changes header}} {{Subject changes |date = 14 June 2018 |update = Teleport Options & Tidying Up |change = The blessed spirit shield, along with the others, was made slightly clearer in-game. Characters with Body type B also now have their own unique model, reducing the distance between the shields and their bodies. }} {{Subject changes |date = 6 November 2014 |update = Amulet of the Damned & CWA |poll = Old_School_Content_Poll_27 |change = The alchemy price of the blessed spirit shield has been lowered from 840,000 coins to 720,000 coins to prevent it from being protected over [[godsword]]s upon death. }} {{Subject changes footer}}
