[[File:Blighted karambwan detail.png|left|120px]]
'''Blighted karambwan''' are a variant of [[cooked karambwan]] that can only be eaten while inside the [[Wilderness]], [[Ferox Enclave]], [[Mage Arena bank]], [[PvP world]]s, [[Castle Wars]] lobby, and [[Clan Wars]] healing 18 hitpoints. 12 can be purchased at [[Justine's stuff for the Last Shopper Standing]] for 1 [[Last Man Standing]] point or at the [[Soul Wars Reward Shop]] for 10 [[Zeal Tokens]].

Unlike most other [[food]], they can be consumed nearly instantly with no delay after consuming another food item, known as "combo eating"; this makes them a favourable item for [[player killing]]. The "combo eating" tactic can be enhanced further by drinking a dose of [[saradomin brew]] alongside a karambwan and the base food item, enabling a player to heal over 50 hitpoints very rapidly.

Attempting to eat the karambwan outside the Wilderness prints the message {{mes|The blighted karambwan can be eaten only in the Wilderness.}}

