{{Infobox Item |defver = 4 |version1 = 1 dose |version2 = 2 dose |version3 = 3 dose |version4 = 4 dose |bucketname1 = (1) |bucketname2 = (2) |bucketname3 = (3) |bucketname4 = (4) |name1 = Blighted super restore(1) |name2 = Blighted super restore(2) |name3 = Blighted super restore(3) |name4 = Blighted super restore(4) |image1 = [[File:Blighted super restore(1).png]] |image2 = [[File:Blighted super restore(2).png]] |image3 = [[File:Blighted super restore(3).png]] |image4 = [[File:Blighted super restore(4).png]] |release = [[23 April]] [[2020]] |update = Bounty Hunter Returns |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Drink, Empty, Drop |examine1 = 1 dose of super restore potion, blighted so it can be used only in the Wilderness. |examine2 = 2 doses of super restore potion, blighted so it can be used only in the Wilderness. |examine3 = 3 doses of super restore potion, blighted so it can be used only in the Wilderness. |examine4 = 4 doses of super restore potion, blighted so it can be used only in the Wilderness. |value1 = 37 |value2 = 38 |value3 = 39 |value4 = 40 |weight1 = 0.020 |weight2 = 0.025 |weight3 = 0.030 |weight4 = 0.035 |exchange1 = No |exchange2 = No |exchange3 = No |exchange4 = Yes |id1 = 24605 |id2 = 24603 |id3 = 24601 |id4 = 24598 }} {{Synced switch |version1= [[File:Blighted super restore(1) detail.png|left|120px]] |version2 = [[File:Blighted super restore(2) detail.png|left|120px]] |version3 = [[File:Blighted super restore(3) detail.png|left|120px]] |version4 = [[File:Blighted super restore(4) detail.png|left|120px]] }} '''Blighted super restore''' potions are a variant of [[super restore]] potion that can only be drunk while inside the [[Wilderness]], [[Ferox Enclave]], [[Mage Arena bank]], [[PvP world]]s, [[Castle Wars]], and [[Clan Wars]]. If a [[Prayer cape]] or [[ring of the gods (i)]] is equipped, or if a Prayer cape or [[holy wrench]] is in the player's inventory, the Prayer restore increases to 8 + 27% of the player's current Prayer level, rounded down. This does not affect the rate of restoration of stats other than Prayer.
4 can be purchased at [[Justine's stuff for the Last Shopper Standing]] for 1 [[Last Man Standing]] point or at the [[Soul Wars Reward Shop]] for 10 [[Zeal Tokens]]. Unlike other potions, only the 4-dose variant is purchasable on the [[Grand Exchange]].
Attempting to drink the potion outside the Wilderness prints the message {{mes|The blighted potion can be used only in the Wilderness.}} However, the potion will act like a regular super restore potion in PvP worlds, which can be useful for Ironman accounts with limited access to prayer-restoring potions.
