{{Infobox Item |name = Blighted vengeance sack |image = [[File:Blighted vengeance sack.png]] |release = [[23 April]] [[2020]] |update = Bounty Hunter Returns |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = Yes |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = Enough power for a Vengeance or or{{sic}} Vengeance Other, blighted so it can be used only in the Wilderness. |value = 33 |weight = 0.000 |exchange = Yes |id = 24621 }} [[File:Blighted vengeance sack detail.png|left|120px]] A '''blighted vengeance sack''' is an item that allows players to cast [[Vengeance]] or [[Vengeance Other]] without needing the [[runes]] for it. However, it can only be used inside the [[Wilderness]], [[Ferox Enclave]], [[Mage Arena bank]], [[PvP world]]s, [[Castle Wars]], [[Clan Wars]], and [[Soul Wars]], while on the [[Lunar spellbook]]. It is consumed upon use.
50 can be purchased at [[Justine's stuff for the Last Shopper Standing]] for 1 [[Last Man Standing]] point or at the [[Soul Wars Reward Shop]] for 10 [[Zeal Tokens]].
