{{Gone|update=Poll 80 & Shooting Stars Changes}} {{Infobox Item |name = Blighted wave sack |image = [[File:Blighted wave sack.png]] |release = [[13 July]] [[2022]] |update = Emir's Arena: Full Launch |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = Yes |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = Enough power for any Wave spell, blighted so it can be used only in the Wilderness. |value = 40 |alchable = No |weight = 0.000 |id = 26704 }} [[File:Blighted wave sack detail.png|left|120px]] A '''blighted wave sack''' was an item purchased from the [[Emir's Arena]] reward shop. It allowed players to cast any [[wave spells]] without needing the [[runes]] for it. However, it could only be used inside the [[Wilderness]] while on the [[standard spellbook]].
The spell sack was consumed upon use, regardless of a [[successful hit]].
On PVP death, unprotected sacks would be converted to 120 coins and dropped as loot for the killer.
Now the [[Blighted surge sack]] is able to cast wave spells, making the wave sack redundant.
