{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Scenery |version1 = Stage 1 |version2 = Grown |name = Blindweed Patch |image1 = [[File:Blindweed Patch (stage 1).png|x300px]] |image2 = [[File:Blindweed Patch (grown).png|x300px]] |release = [[31 October]] [[2005]] |update = Rum Deal |members = Yes |quest = [[Rum Deal]] |location = [[Braindeath Island]] |options1 = Inspect |options2 = Pick, Inspect |examine1 = Something is growing here. |examine2 = Fully grown Blindweed. |map = No |id1 = 10101 |id2 = 10102 |leagueRegion = Morytania }} '''Blindweed''' is a [[Farming]] plant grown during [[Rum Deal]]. The patch is located in the south-eastern part of [[Braindeath Island]]. It is grown by planting a [[blindweed seed]], which requires 40 [[Farming]]. After about 5 minutes, the patch will be fully grown and can be harvested for [[blindweed]]. The patch cannot become diseased.
==Farming info== {{Farming info |name = Blindweed seed |level = 40 |patch = Blindweed patch |seed = {{plink|Blindweed seed}} |seedsper = 1 |payment = No |time = 5 min |plant = [[Blindweed Patch]] |crop = {{plink|Blindweed}} |yield = 1 |regrow = No |plantxp = 32 |checkxp = No |harvestxp = 45 }}
==Growth stages== {{Growth stages |stage1 = [[File:Blindweed Patch (stage 1).png|87px]] |stage2 = [[File:Blindweed Patch (grown).png|200px]] }}
==Trivia== *Trying to use any kind of [[compost]] on the patch results in the message "The soil in this patch is so poor that this will not make any difference."
{{Farming plants}}

{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Item |name = Blindweed seed |image = [[File:Blindweed seed 1.png]] [[File:Blindweed seed 2.png]] [[File:Blindweed seed 3.png]] [[File:Blindweed seed 4.png]] [[File:Blindweed seed 5.png]] |release = [[31 October]] [[2005]] |update = Rum Deal |members = Yes |quest = [[Rum Deal]] |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = Yes |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = A Blindweed seed - plant in a Blindweed patch. |value = 166 |weight = 0.000 |id = 6710 }} [[File:Blindweed seed detail.png|left|180px]] '''Blindweed seed''' is a [[quest item]] that the player must grow during the [[Rum Deal]] [[quest]]. It is planted in the Blindweed farming patch on the south-eastern part of [[Braindeath Island]]. Players do not need a [[watering can]] or a form of [[compost]] after planting the blindweed seed.
A nearby gardener will '''not''' watch over your growing blindweed, but blindweed cannot become diseased.
When harvested it yields [[blindweed]], which is the first ingredient of the [[unsanitary swill]] that the player must make during the quest. Planting a blindweed seed grants 32 [[Farming]] experience and harvesting the blindweed grants 45 Farming experience.
