==Trivia==
* Unlike most trees, when the blisterwood tree "depletes", instead of being chopped down into a stump, it spawns a spider, along with a chat message stating {{Mes|A small spider jumps at you from the log you just cut.}}
* During the [[Demonic Pacts League]], players with [[Endless Harvest (Demonic Pacts League)|Endless Harvest]] would instead get the chat messages: {{Mes|A small spider jumps at you from the log you just cut. It lands next to your foot.}}, {{Mes|A small spider jumps at you from the log you just cut. It bounces off your axe as you swing at the tree.}}, {{Mes|A small spider jumps at you from the log you just cut. It does a flip. Cool!}}, {{Mes|A small spider jumps at you from the log you just cut. You ignore it.}} and, {{Mes|A small spider jumps at you from the log you just cut. You brush it off your shoulder.}}
* Using [[Secateurs]] on the blisterwood tree fails with the message {{Mes|The branches on this blisterwood tree are too strong to be cut with secateurs.}}
* If a player uses a [[Herring]] on the blisterwood tree the chatbox will state {{Mes|This is indeed a mighty tree. But alas, it is not the mightiest tree in the forest.}}A reference to ''[[wikipedia:Monty_Python_and_the_Holy_Grail|Monty Python and the Holy Grail]].''

