{{Infobox Combat Achievement |name = Blizzard Dodger |image = [[File:Ice demon.png|100px]] |release = [[21 July]] [[2021]] |update = Combat Achievements |members = Yes |description = Receive kill-credit for the Ice Demon without activating the Protect from Range prayer. |tier = Elite |monster = Chambers of Xeric |type = Restriction |id = 320 |leagueRegion = Kourend }} '''Blizzard Dodger''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to receive kill-credit for the [[Ice Demon]] without activating the [[Protect from Range]] prayer.
== Strategy == '''For solo-run attempts, be sure raid scaling is set to "0" for the easiest fight, as scaling a raid to "1" doubles boss health.'''
By having another player use protect from range and dodge the demon's attacks in the centre of the room, additional players can stand on the north/eastern walls and avoid the demon's aggression completely. Using [[Fire Surge]] will help secure kill-credit over players using ranged.
Ironmen must be the only player damaging the Ice Demon to complete this combat achievement.
