{{External|rs}} {{Infobox Monster |version1 = Round |version2 = Pointed |name = Blood Blamish Snail |image1 = [[File:Blood Blamish Snail (round).png|200px]] |image2 = [[File:Blood Blamish Snail (pointed).png|200px]] |release = [[14 October]] [[2004]] |update = Morytania Expansion |members = Yes |combat = 20 |size = 1 |examine = A blood coloured blamish snail, these types are said to spit acid. |xpbonus = 0 |max hit1 = 2 |max hit2 = 3 |aggressive = Yes |poisonous = No |attack style = [[Ranged]] |attack speed = 6 |respawn = 50 |slayxp = Not assigned |hitpoints1 = 13 |hitpoints2 = 10 |att = 0 |str = 0 |def1 = 45 |def2 = 30 |mage = 1 |range1 = 12 |range2 = 21 |attbns = 10 |strbns = 10 |amagic = 0 |mbns = 0 |arange = 0 |rngbns = 0 |dstab = 5 |dslash = 5 |dcrush = 30 |dmagic = 5 |dlight = 50 |dstandard = 50 |dheavy = 50 |elementalweaknesstype = Earth |elementalweaknesspercent = 30 |poisonresistance = 0 |venomresistance = 0 |immunecannon = No |immunethrall = No |dropversion1 = Round |dropversion2 = Pointed |id1 = 2645 |id2 = 2650 }} The '''Blood Blamish Snail''' is a type of snail which live in the north-east part of [[Mort Myre Swamp]]. A [[chisel]] can be used on the dropped shell to make a [[blood'n'tar snelm]] which gains the player 32.5 [[Crafting]] [[experience]]. This is the same for all snelms. They also provide bonus protection against [[Mort Myre]] snail attacks.
