[[File:Blood moon armour set detail.png|130px|left]]
'''Blood moon armour set''' is an item obtained by exchanging a set of items with a [[Grand Exchange clerk]] via their right-click "Sets" option and clicking on the appropriate [[item set]] within the Item Sets interface.

It is commonly made in order to conveniently sell all four components of the [[Blood moon armour]] at once.

