The '''blood rift''' in the [[Abyss]] transports players to the [[Blood Altar]], provided that [[Sins of the Father]] has been completed.

The rift can also access the false [[Blood Altar (Kourend)|Blood Altar]] in [[Great Kourend]], which can be accessed from the blood rift after players have first crafted blood runes on the altar. At that point, players can use a single [[dark essence block]] or [[dark essence fragments]] on the rift, which does not consume the dark essence and permanently unlocks transport through the rift.

