{{Infobox Item |name = Blood rune |image = [[File:Blood rune (Barbarian Assault).png]] |release = [[13 March]] [[2013]] |update = Patch Notes (13 March 2013) |members = No |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = Yes |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = Used for high level missile spells. |value = 1 |weight = 0.000 |id = 11697 }} [[File:Blood rune (Barbarian Assault) detail.png|left|120px]] '''Blood runes''' are a variant of normal [[blood rune]]s which can be obtained from the Attacker item machine when playing the Attacker role in [[Barbarian Assault]]. To prevent any glitches where players may be able to take runes outside of the minigame and sell them for profit, the machine gives untradeable runes that have no value. Normally, they will disappear if the player attempts to take them outside.
