{{Infobox Scenery |name = Blood rune |image = [[File:{{PAGENAME}}.png|250x250px]] |release = [[5 September]] [[2013]] |update = Will you wake up from the Nightmare Zone? |members = Yes |quest = No |location = [[Nightmare Zone]] |options = Pick-up |examine = Used for high level missile spells. |map = {{Map|x:2271,y:4705|x:2276,y:4685|mapID=-1|plane=0|mtype=pin}} |id = 26285 }}
The '''Blood rune''' is found on the floor inside the [[Nightmare Zone]] when either the [[Dagannoth Mother]] or [[Gelatinnoth Mother]] is present in the session. Picking up the blood runes gives the player 100 [[Blood rune (nz)|Blood runes]].
{{Nightmare Zone}}

{{Infobox Item |name = Blood rune (nz) |image = [[File:Blood rune (nz).png]] |release = [[5 September]] [[2013]] |update = Will you wake up from the Nightmare Zone? |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = Yes |noteable = No |options = Discard |examine = For use in the Nightmare Zone. |value = 0 |weight = 0.000 |id = 11714 }} [[File:Blood rune (nz) detail.png|left|120px]] A '''blood rune (nz)''' is a [[Nightmare Zone]] exclusive version of a [[blood rune]]. They spawn on the ground if either the [[Dagannoth mother]] or [[Gelatinnoth mother]] is present in a Nightmare Zone session, as their combat mechanics require the use of all four types of elemental spells to damage them.
As with all items with the (nz) suffix, they cannot be taken outside of the Nightmare Zone, and if discarded, can be retrieved from the same place it spawned. Runes with the (nz) suffix cannot be used to cast non-combat spells (except for [[Bones to Bananas]] and [[Bones to Peaches]]), and all spells cast have heavily reduced Magic experience (though this does not apply to experienced gained from damage dealt.) <!--(Need to add: how many runes are taken at a time)-->
{{Nightmare Zone}}

{{external|rs=Blood necklace shard}} {{Infobox Item |name = Blood shard |image = [[File:Blood shard.png]] |release = [[4 June]] [[2020]] |update = Darkmeyer |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Drop |examine = A magical shard filled with a dark power. |value = 200000 |weight = 0.010 |exchange = Yes |id = 24777 |leagueRegion = Morytania }} [[File:Blood shard detail.png|100px|left]] The '''blood shard''' is a drop from [[vyrewatch sentinel]]s and from pickpocketing [[Vyre (Thieving)|vampyres]] in [[Darkmeyer]]. The blood shard can be added to an [[amulet of fury]], making it an [[amulet of blood fury]]. This amulet has the same stats as a regular amulet of fury, but grants a 20% chance of healing 30% of the damage dealt to a target '''when using melee''', resulting in an approximate 6% lifesteal. A blood shard provides the amulet with 10,000 charges, losing one for every [[successful hit]]. Once the amulet reaches 0 charges the blood shard is destroyed, but the amulet of fury remains.
The effect of the [[rogue equipment]] ''does'' apply to this item when pickpocketing; the player will have a chance to receive two Blood Shards if they are wearing parts of the outfit, with it guaranteed if the full set is worn. While pickpocketing with a full inventory, both Blood Shards will drop to the floor.
