{{External|rs}} {{Cache}} {{Infobox Item |name = Blood tithe pouch |image = [[File:Blood tithe pouch.png]] |release = [[4 September]] [[2006]] |update = Myreque Pt III - Darkness of Hallowvale |members = Yes |quest = [[Darkness of Hallowvale]] |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = A pouch filled with blood. |value = 1 |weight = 0.001 |id = 9650 }} [[File:Blood tithe pouch detail.png|left|150px]] The '''blood tithe pouch''' is an unobtainable item released with [[Darkness of Hallowvale]]. It presumably would have been an item that players would have obtained during the quest.
A similar item can be seen served by a [[vyrewatch]] to [[Vanescula Drakan]] and [[Ranis Drakan]] during a [[cutscene]] in [[Darkness of Hallowvale]]. It is not possible to obtain the item in-game. [[File:Darkness of Hallowvale - the Drakans.png|thumb|left|330px|Vanescula and Ranis Drakan being served a blood tithe pouch by a vyrewatch.]]
