{{Gone}} {{Infobox Relic |name = Bloodthirsty |image = [[File:Bloodthirsty.png]] |release = [[15 November]] [[2023]] |update = Leagues IV - Trailblazer Reloaded |removal = [[10 January]] [[2024]] |removalupdate = Children of the Sun |members = Yes |league = Trailblazer Reloaded League |tier = 5 }} [[File:Bloodthirsty detail.png|left]] '''Bloodthirsty''' was a Tier 5 Relic in the [[Trailblazer Reloaded League]], and gave the following benefits: * Players can receive and cancel [[slayer tasks]] remotely via slayer helmets/gem/rings. * [[Expeditious bracelet]]s and [[bracelets of slaughter]] have a 35% chance to proc their effects, and no longer consumes charges. {{clear|left}} [[Superior slayer monster]]s will have the following buffs: * Spawn chance is increased to 1/25. * Slayer points are given upon killing one based on Slayer level requirement and difficulty. * Six rolls on their normal counterpart's drop table (excluding unique superior table) * 25% chance for a superior slayer monster to spawn as a bloodthirsty variant, which has the following: ** Nine rolls on their normal counterpart's drop table ** A guaranteed clue scroll drop if eligible ** A roll on the bloodthirsty unique drop table
A list of bloodthirsty monster variants follows: {{div col|colwidth=15em}} *[[Bloodthirsty Hydra]] *[[Bloodthirsty Nechryarch]] *[[Bloodthirsty Cockathrice]] *[[Bloodthirsty Shadow Wyrm]] *[[Bloodthirsty Night beast]] *[[Bloodthirsty abomination]] *[[Bloodthirsty Drake]] *[[Bloodthirsty twisted banshee]] *[[Bloodthirsty kurask]] *[[Bloodthirsty smoke devil]] *[[Bloodthirsty Turoth]] *[[Bloodthirsty abyssal demon]] *[[Bloodthirsty choke devil]] *[[Bloodthirsty Bloodveld]] *[[Bloodthirsty mutated Bloodveld]] *[[Bloodthirsty banshee]] *[[Bloodthirsty Basilisk Sentinel]] *[[Bloodthirsty basilisk]] *[[Bloodthirsty gargoyle]] *[[Bloodthirsty warped Jelly]] *[[Bloodthirsty Jelly]] *[[Bloodthirsty pyrelord]] *[[Bloodthirsty Infernal pyrelord]] {{div col end}}
==Trivia== * Bloodthirsty variants exist in the game cache for the [[Bloodthirsty Crawler|crawler]], [[Bloodthirsty Mage|mage]], [[Bloodthirsty Repugnant spectre|repugnant spectre]], [[Bloodthirst rockslug|rockslug]], [[Bloodthirsty hand|hand]], and [[Bloodthirsty spectre|spectre]]. Since these monsters were never given as a Slayer assignment in Trailblazer Reloaded League, the bloodthirsty form was never possible to encounter.
