The '''bloodthirsty infernal pyrelord''' was a variant of the [[infernal pyrelord]], the [[superior]] form of the [[pyrelord]], that may appear after unlocking the [[Bloodthirsty]] [[Trailblazer Reloaded League/Relics|relic]] in [[Trailblazer Reloaded League]]. Like standard superior variants, the player must be on the appropriate Slayer task in order for them to spawn.

It had a 25% chance of spawning in place of an infernal pyrelord, which have a 4% chance of appearing after killing a pyrelord.

