The '''bloodthirsty mage''' was an unused variant of the [[malevolent mage]], the [[superior]] form of the [[infernal mage]], that would have appeared after unlocking the [[Bloodthirsty]] [[Trailblazer Reloaded League/Relics|relic]] in [[Trailblazer Reloaded League]]. Because internal mages could not be assigned as a Slayer task during the league, it was never possible to encounter a bloodthirsty mage.

It would have had a 25% chance of spawning in place of a malevolent mage, which have a 4% chance of appearing after killing an infernal mage.

