The '''bloodthirsty hand''' was an unused variant of the [[crushing hand]], the [[superior]] form of the [[crawling hand]], that would have appeared after unlocking the [[Bloodthirsty]] [[Trailblazer Reloaded League/Relics|relic]] in [[Trailblazer Reloaded League]]. Because crawling hands could not be assigned as a Slayer task during the league, it was never possible to encounter a bloodthirsty hand.

It would have had a 25% chance of spawning in place of a crushing hand, which have a 4% chance of appearing after killing a crawling hand.

