{{Infobox Item |name = Bloody grimoire |image = [[File:Bloody grimoire.png]] |release = [[24 May]] [[2018]] |update = A Taste of Hope |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Read, Drop |examine = An old book about potions. |value = 1 |weight = 0.510 |respawn = 100 |id = 22420 }} [[File:Bloody grimoire detail.png|left|150px]] The '''bloody grimoire''' is an old book that can be found in the [[Sisterhood Sanctuary]]. It can only be obtained by using the [[Telekinetic Grab]] spell to reach it.
The book is authored by [[Otrava]], a member of [[the Sisterhood]]. It describes the author's discovery of a damaged version of the Senntisten Scriptures from their slain enemies, and details how they used their newfound knowledge of blood magic to create blood potions; namely, the [[bastion potion|bastion]] and [[battlemage potion]]s.
In addition, the book lists two more recipes for a 'totality potion' and 'vigour potion' that were crossed out due to instability and a lack of ingredients, respectively.
This book '''cannot''' be stored in a [[player-owned house]] [[bookcase]].
