{{External|rs|rsc}} {{Infobox Shop |name = Blue Moon Inn |image = [[File:Blue Moon Inn.png|300px]] |release = [[4 January]] [[2001]] |update = Runescape beta is now online! |members = No |icon = [[File:Pub icon.png]] |location = [[Varrock]] |owner = [[Bartender (Blue Moon Inn)|Bartender]] |special = [[Beer]] |map = {{Map|mtype=polygon|3216,3397|3216,3394|3217,3393|3221,3393|3222,3394|3225,3394|3226,3393|3233,3393|3233,3395|3234,3396|3234,3397|3233,3398|3233,3403|3222,3403|3222,3404|3219,3404|3219,3403|3218,3403|3218,3397|bucket=yes}} |leagueRegion = Misthalin }} [[File:Sign (Blue Moon Inn).png|60px|left]] The '''Blue Moon Inn''' is the [[bar (location)|tavern and inn]] in south-central [[Varrock]], marked by a [[Sign (Blue Moon Inn)|sign]] at the front and back of the building. The [[NPC]]s inside play a role in several [[quest]]s. [[Jonny the Beard]] is involved in the [[Shield of Arrav]] quest, [[Dr Harlow]] features in the [[Vampyre Slayer]] quest, and there is also a treasure chest upstairs that plays a part in [[Pirate's Treasure]]. The establishment is repeatedly described as the "Blue moon pub" by Charlie the Tramp in the Shield of Arrav quest. It is called the "Blue Moon inn" by Aris.
The Blue Moon Inn is featured in the [[Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl]] [[miniquest]].
