{{otheruses|the item|the [[Hunter]] creature|Blue crab (Hunter)}} {{Infobox Item |name = Blue crab |image = [[File:Blue crab.png]] |release = [[19 November]] [[2025]] |update = Sailing is OUT TODAY! |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Drop |examine = You'll need something to break through that shell. |value = 150 |weight = 0.600 |exchange = Yes |id = 31674 }} [[File:Blue crab detail.png|150px|left]] '''Blue crabs''' are captured [[Blue crab (Hunter)|blue crabs]] in item form, caught via [[crab trapping]] on [[the Great Conch]]. This requires level 48 [[Hunter]] and grants 136 experience.
A blue crab can be prepared with a [[knife]] to produce [[raw blue crab meat]], which can then be cooked into [[blue crab meat]] at level 48 [[Cooking]]. Alternatively, it can be ground with a [[pestle and mortar]] to produce [[crab paste]], which are used to create [[anti-odour salt]] or [[super hunter potion]]s.
