{{otheruses|the [[Hunter]] creature|the item|Blue crab}} {{Infobox NPC |name = Blue crab |image = [[File:Blue crab (Hunter).png|300px]] |release = [[19 November]] [[2025]] |update = Sailing is OUT TODAY! |members = Yes |location = [[The Great Conch]] |options = None |examine = No one likes crabs... |map = No |id = 15090 |leagueRegion = No }} '''Blue crabs''' can be caught by [[crab trapping]] on [[The Great Conch]]. In order to catch the crabs, a [[Crab trap (empty)|crab trap]] must first be built over an empty [[Hole (Crab trapping)|hole]] and baited with [[fish offcuts]]. Catching a blue crab awards 136 [[Hunter]] experience. The crab can then either be prepared with a [[knife]] to produce [[raw blue crab meat]], which can then be [[Cooking|cooked]] into [[blue crab meat]], or the crab can be processed with a [[pestle and mortar]] to produce [[crab paste#Blue crab|crab paste]], a [[Herblore secondaries|Herblore secondary]] used in the creation of [[Anti-odour salt]] and [[Super hunter potion|Super hunter potions]].
==Location== {{LocTableHead}} {{LocLine |Name = Blue crab |location = North coast of [[The Great Conch]] |members = Yes |levels = N/A |spawns = 21 |mapID = -1 |plane = 0 |x:3251,y:2432 |leagueRegion = N/A }} {{LocLine |Name = Blue crab |location = East coast of [[The Great Conch]] |members = Yes |levels = N/A |spawns = 16 |mapID = -1 |plane = 0 |x:3213,y:2514 |leagueRegion = N/A }} {{LocTableBottom}}
