'''Blue flowers''' can be found just outside the red team's base in the [[Trouble Brewing]] minigame. Up to 5 [[Blue flowers (Trouble Brewing)|blue flowers]] can be picked at a time. 

Attempting to pick blue flowers while already having 5 in the inventory will yield the message {{mes|You have plenty of those.}}, and attempting to pick blue flowers while on the red team will yield the message {{mes|You need red flowers, not blue ones!}}.

