{{External|rs=Blue hallowe'en mask|rsc=Halloween mask (blue)}} {{Infobox Item |name = Blue halloween mask |image = [[File:Blue halloween mask.png]] |release = [[31 October]] [[2002]] |update = No |members = No |quest = No |tradeable = Yes |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = Yes |options = Wear, Drop |examine = Aaaarrrghhh ... I'm a monster. |value = 15 |weight = 0.340 |exchange = Yes |id = 1055 }} [[File:Blue halloween mask detail.png|left|150px]] [[File:Blue halloween mask chathead.png|left]] The '''Blue halloween mask''' is a tradeable cosmetic item. Blue halloween masks can be obtained by completing one of the [[Halloween event|Halloween]] [[holiday events]] that occur once per year. This also rewards the player with all other holiday items associated with Halloween.
After player decided polls, it was decided that all tradeable rares will be distributed during their corresponding holiday events thus making them seasonal rares and not completely rare, this to prevent them from being worth hundreds of millions of coins again, like in ''RuneScape 3''.
Previously, they were obtainable during the [[2013 Rare Drops]] event (from [[17 June]] to [[24 June]]) as part of a [[Blue h'ween Mask (2013 Rare Drops)|rare item drop]].
