'''Blue trimmed wizard robes''' are a [[Wizard robes|blue wizard robe set]] with a black trim. The pieces are possible rewards from [[Clue scroll (easy)|easy]] [[Treasure Trails]]. This set has the same bonuses as their regular blue counterparts but is worn by players to show a form of wealth. Unlike the regular robes, they cannot be combined with [[Black dye]] to try to create [[Black trimmed wizard robes]].

