'''Blurite''' is a rare metal obtained from [[Blurite rocks|blurite rocks]] that plays a role in [[The Knight's Sword]] quest. It has uses in [[Fletching]] and is used for an [[Falador Diary#Easy|easy Falador Diary]] task. All blurite items are untradeable. Blurite may only be used in Fletching once a player has completed The Knight's Sword quest. Blurite items include:

*[[Blurite ore]]
*[[Blurite bar]]
*[[Blurite limbs|Blurite crossbow limbs]]
*[[Blurite crossbow]]
*[[Blurite bolts]]
*[[Blurite sword]]

{{Disambig}}
{{Blurite}}

{{External|rs|dw=Blurite Ingot}} {{Infobox Item |name = Blurite bar |image = [[File:Blurite bar.png]] |release = [[31 July]] [[2006]] |update = Crossbows |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Drop |examine = It's a bar of blurite. |value = 18 |weight = 1.814 |id = 9467 }} [[File:Blurite bar detail.png|left|120px]] A '''blurite bar''' is a bar of refined [[blurite]]. It can be created through the [[Smithing]] [[skill]] at level 13 by using [[blurite ore]] on a [[furnace]] or level 10 by using [[Superheat Item]] on the ore, granting 8 Smithing [[experience]]. A blurite bar can be smithed on an [[anvil]], through the Smithing skill to create [[blurite bolts (unf)]] for use in the creation of [[blurite bolts]], or [[blurite limbs]] for use in the creation of a [[blurite crossbow]] and also to complete a task in the [[Falador_Diary#Easy|Falador Easy Diary]] when smithed on [[Doric]]'s anvil.
==Creation== <tabber> Standard= {{Recipe |skill1 = Smithing |skill1lvl = 13 |skill1boostable = Yes |skill1exp = 8 |notes = {{SCP|Quest}} Completion of [[The Knight's Sword]] |members = Yes |ticks = 4 |facilities = Furnace |mat1 = Blurite ore |mat1cost = No |output1 = Blurite bar |output1cost = No |output1subtxt = Regular furnace }} |-| Superheat= {{Recipe |skill1 = Smithing |skill1lvl = 10 |skill1boostable = Yes |skill1exp = 8 |skill2 = Magic |skill2lvl = 43 |skill2boostable = Yes |skill2exp = 53 |notes = {{SCP|Quest}} Completion of [[The Knight's Sword]] |members = Yes |ticks = 3 |mat1 = Blurite ore |mat1cost = No |mat2 = Nature rune |mat3 = Fire rune |mat3quantity = 4 |output1 = Blurite bar |output1cost = No |output1subtxt = Superheat }} </tabber>
