{{External|rs|dw=Blurite Crossbow}} {{Infobox Item |name = Blurite crossbow |image = [[File:Blurite crossbow.png]] |release = [[31 July]] [[2006]] |update = Crossbows |members = Yes |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wield, Drop |examine = A blurite crossbow. |value = 93 |weight = 4.000 |id = 9176 }} [[File:Blurite crossbow detail.png|left|130px]] A '''blurite crossbow''' is a [[crossbow (weapon)|crossbow]] stronger than the [[bronze crossbow]] but weaker than the [[iron crossbow]]. It requires 16 [[Ranged]] to wield and can only fire [[Bronze bolts|bronze]] or [[blurite bolts]]. It has an attack range of 7, increased to 9 with long range.
Blurite crossbows require 24 [[Fletching]] to be made. An [[oak stock]] must be fletched from [[oak logs]], yielding 16 Fletching [[experience]], then [[blurite limbs]] must be attached to the stock with a [[hammer]], yielding 32 Fletching experience and an [[blurite crossbow (u)|unstrung blurite crossbow]]. Finally, the crossbow must be strung with a [[crossbow string]], yielding 16 experience. In total, making a blurite crossbow yields 64 Fletching experience.
[[The Knight's Sword]] quest must be completed before a player can create this crossbow.
