==Trivia== * This ore may be a play on words on "blue, right?", which is backed up by its examine text. * In the quest [[The Knight's Sword|Knight's Sword]], [[Thurgo]] smiths the sword from [[Iron bar|iron bars]] and blurite ore instead of using any [[Blurite bar|blurite bars]], which is required for smithing other [[Blurite bar|blurite]] equipment.
