'''Boat building supplies''' is an interactive scenery in the [[March 2025 Sailing Alpha]]. It provides tools and materials required for customising boats, as well as a [[redberry pie]], required for [[Prying Times]].
While the interface is open, any item in the inventory can be clicked to ''destroy'' that item. As items cannot be dropped in the [[Shipyard (Sailing)|shipyard]], this interface can be used to free up space in the player's inventory without having to leave the shipyard. '''There is no warning when using the Destroy options on items in the inventory.'''

[[File:Boat building supplies interface.png|thumb|The Sailing Supplies interface]]

Non-stackable items can be withdrawn in quantities of 1, 5, 10, or X, while stackable items can be withdrawn in quantities of 10,000.

