{{Otheruses|the interactive board used for shipbuilding|the unlockable high-level schematics|Lost schematics}} {{Infobox Scenery |name = Boat schematics |image = [[File:Boat schematics.png|250x250px]] |release = [[19 November]] [[2025]] |update = Sailing is OUT TODAY! |members = Yes |location = [[Shipyard]] |options = Modify |examine = Looks complicated... Hope it'll stay afloat! |map = {{Map|x=2082|y=2724|mtype=pin}} |id = 59718 }} '''Boat schematics''' is an interactive board in the [[Shipyard]] used for [[shipbuilding]]. The board must be interacted with to customize the [[core boat parts]] of your [[boat]], as well as the [[flags]] and [[boat paint]]s.
Changing the hull or mast and sail results in, respectively, the following chatboxes: * "You get to work with the shipyard workers to change out the hull of your boat..." * "You get to work with the shipyard workers to change out the mast and sail of your boat..."
