{{Otheruses|the item|the scenery object|Caged monkey (Bob)}} {{Gone|update=Shooting Stars}} {{Infobox Item |name = Bob's caged monkey |image = [[File:Bob's caged monkey.png]] |release = [[17 February]] [[2021]] |update = 8th Birthday Event and LMS Changes |removal = [[17 March]] [[2021]] |removalupdate = Shooting Stars |members = No |quest = [[2021 Birthday event]] |tradeable = No |bankable = No |equipable = No |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Talk-to, Release |destroy = ''Release'' - You will have to recover it from Bob again. |examine = A monkey trapped in a crate. |value = 0 |alchable = No |weight = 1.500 |id = hist25509 }} [[File:Bob's caged monkey detail.png|left|120px]] [[File:Monkey on unicorn chathead.png|left]] '''Bob's caged monkey''' is a [[monkey cage]] containing the monkey that was on [[Bob]]'s back during the [[2021 Birthday event]]. To catch the monkey, the cage must be placed near Bob or used on him, at which point a cutscene will play of the monkey being lured into the cage.
The caged monkey cannot be deposited into a bank. If players try to bank it, the chatbox will state "A magical force prevents you from banking this item!" On death, the caged monkey is always deleted from the player's inventory.
