'''Bob''' is the owner of [[Bob's Brilliant Axes]] in southern [[Lumbridge]]. During the [[2021 Birthday event]] he finds himself harassed by a monkey on his back, which the player must capture.

After capturing the monkey on Bob's back, the player receives a [[Bob's caged monkey]].

