==Trivia==
*Bob's name is a play on [[Wikipedia:Bob Barker|Bob Barker]], the name of the former host of the game show ''[[Wikipedia:The Price is Right|The Price is Right]]'', and the word "barter".
*In one go, Bob can decant up to 2,147,483,647 (the maximum number of items allowed in a stack) doses of up to 27 types of potions.
*While decanting potions, Bob may say "''Two plus two is four, minus one that's three...''", a reference to the song "{{wp|Man's Not Hot}}" by Big Shaq.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Maz|url=https://twitter.com/SquirrelledMaz/status/1216479802171019269|date=12 January 2020|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20200117130803/https://twitter.com/SquirrelledMaz/status/1216479802171019269|archivedate=17 January 2020|quote=[Wonder if GE decanter man intentionally says the same line as Man's Not Hot (viral ironic grime music song: https://youtu.be/k3jlviX88iw?t=15)] Hehehe, Yes, that was going round the office a lot when I was writing that update.}}

