{{External|rs=Icon of Bob}} {{Infobox Construction |name = Bob icon |image = [[File:Bob icon built.png|250px]] |icon = [[File:Bob icon icon.png]] |furniturename = Icon of Bob |release = [[31 May]] [[2006]] |update = PLAYER-OWNED HOUSES! |level = 71 |experience = 1,160 |room = [[Chapel]] |hotspot = [[Icon space]] |flatpack = No |examine = An icon of the mysterious Bob. |id = 13178 |itemid = 8061 }} The '''Bob icon''' can be built in the [[icon space]] of the [[chapel]] in a [[player-owned house]]. It requires 71 [[Construction]] to build and gives 1,160 [[experience]] when built. The player must have a [[hammer]] and a [[saw]] in their inventory to build it.
Building this icon aligns the player's chapel toward [[Bob the Jagex Cat]]. It does not align the symbol on the [[Altar space|altar]] however; the altar will remain in its default alignment to [[Saradomin]]. It will also change the statues in the room to statues of cats.
