{{Infobox Item |name = Bob the cat slippers |image = [[File:Bob the cat slippers.png]] |release = [[22 February]] [[2023]] |update = 10th Birthday Event |members = No |quest = No |tradeable = No |equipable = Yes |stackable = No |noteable = No |options = Wear, Change-style, Destroy |wornoptions = Change-style |destroy = You can get a replacement from Diango. |examine = No cats were harmed in the making of these slippers. |value = 1 |alchable = No |weight = 0.200 |id = 27806 }} [[File:Bob the cat slippers detail.png|left|130px]] '''Bob the cat slippers''' are an item that can be obtained from participating in any [[birthday event]], and were first obtained from the [[2023 Birthday event]]. They are styled after [[Bob (cat)|Bob the cat]], and have a "Change-style" option that switches them into a pair of [[Jad slippers]].
