{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard Dialogue==
===Before Cabin Fever===
* '''Bill Teach:''' Mumblelandlubbermumblemumble...
* '''Player:''' Hello!
* '''Bill Teach:''' What right have ye to be so happy, landlubber?
* '''Player:''' Well it is quite a nice day.
* '''Bill Teach:''' Aye, that it is.
* '''Bill Teach:''' Will ye forgive an old sailor his temper [lad/lass/kid]? I'm in dire straits indeed.
* '''Player:''' What's the problem? I may be able to help.
* '''Bill Teach:''' I dunno, [lad/lass/kid], I need a pirate to help me with my problem, but none will sail with me.
* '''Bill Teach:''' Well, ye look like ye might have the right stuff, tell me would ye like te be a pirate?
* {{topt|Yes, I've always wanted to be a pirate!}}
** {{tact|Continues in [[Transcript:Cabin Fever]]}}
* {{topt|No thanks, it sounds quite dangerous.}}
** '''Player:''' No thanks, it sounds quite dangerous.
** '''Bill Teach:''' Aye, that it be. Come back when yer liver ain't so lily-like, [lad/lass/kid].
** {{tact|end}}

===After completing [[Cabin Fever]]===
====Inside [[The Green Ghost]]====
* '''Bill Teach:''' If yer after a lift go to the ship and I'll take ye where ye want to go.
* {{tact|end}}

====On board [[The Adventurous]]====
* '''Bill Teach:''' I suppose ye'll be wantin' a lift while yer here, right [lad/lass/kid]?
* {{topt|cond=If the player has lost their [[Book o' piracy]]:|Cap'n, I lost that book you gave me.}}
** '''Player:''' Cap'n, I lost that book you gave me.
** '''Bill Teach:''' Ye'll notice I'm not fallin' to the floor in shock right now. Look, if I gives ye another copy will ye keep a better eye on it?
** '''Player:''' Aye Cap'n!
** '''Bill Teach:''' Then here, have this other copy I dug up.
** {{tact|receives=Book o' piracy}}
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Yes Cap'n, I'd like a lift.}}
** '''Player:''' Yes Cap'n, I'd like a lift. If you aren't busy.
*** {{tcond|If the player is at [[Port Phasmatys]]:}}
**** '''Bill Teach:''' No, I should be gettin' back anyway. Come on [lad/lass/kid], let's be off.
**** {{tact|The player is transported to [[Mos Le'Harmless]]}}
**** {{tact|end}}
*** {{tcond|If the player is at Mos Le'Harmless:}}
**** '''Bill Teach:''' Nothin' I won't put on hold. Come on [lad/lass/kid], let's be off.
**** {{tact|The player is transported to Port Phasmatys}}
**** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|No thanks, Cap'n.}}
** '''Player:''' No thanks, Cap'n.
** '''Bill Teach:''' Well, come see me if ye ever do.
** {{tact|end}}

