{{Transcript|NPC}}

==When filling a bloated toad with [[ogre bellows]] without carrying a [[Rock (elemental)|rock]] or [[ball of wool]]==
* {{tbox|pic=Rock (elemental) detail.png|pic2=Ball of wool detail.png|You need some wool and a rock in order to keep this highly inflated toad from flying around everywhere.}}
* {{tact|The highly bloated toad drifts off into the air.}}

==When filling a bloated toad with ogre bellows while carrying both==
* {{mes|You manage to inflate a bloated toad with the swamp gas.}}
* {{mes|You blow the bloated toad up into a balloon toad.}}
* {{tact|receives=a [[balloon toad]]}}

==Overhead dialogue==
===When eaten by a [[chompy bird]]===
* '''Chompy bird:''' {{overhead|Sqwark!}}
* '''Bloated toad:''' {{overhead|!!Croak!!}}
* '''Chompy bird:''' {{overhead|Gobble!}}

