{{Transcript|item}}

==When combined with an [[amulet of fury]]==
* {{tbox|pic=Amulet of fury detail.png|pic2=Blood shard detail.png|{{Colour|#7f0000|Warning!}} The Amulet of fury will consume your Blood shard to make the Amulet of blood fury and you won't be able to get it back.}}
* {{tbox|pic=Amulet of fury detail.png|pic2=Blood shard detail.png|The Amulet of blood fury is untradeable.}}
* {{tselect|Are you sure you wish to do this?}}
* {{topt|Yes, combine the Blood shard with the Amulet of fury.}}
** {{tbox|pic=Amulet of blood fury detail.png|You have successfully created an Amulet of blood fury.}}
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|No, I'll keep my Blood shard.}}
** {{tact|end}}

==When combined with an [[amulet of blood fury]]==
* {{tselect|Use the Blood shard to add charges to the amulet?}}
* {{topt|Yes, recharge my Amulet of blood fury.}}
** {{tcond|If charging the amulet does not result in wasted charges:}}
*** {{tbox|pic=Amulet of blood fury detail.png|You have successfully added 10,000 hits to your Amulet of blood fury. It will now work for (amount of charges) more hits.}}
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If charging the amulet would result in wasted charges:}}
*** {{tbox|pic=Amulet of blood fury detail.png|pic2=Blood shard detail.png|{{Colour|#7f0000|Warning!}} Your Amulet of blood fury is nearly at maximum capacity and will be capped at 30,000 hits.}}
*** {{tselect|Recharge anyway?}}
*** {{topt|Yes, recharge my Amulet of blood fury.}}
**** {{tbox|pic=Amulet of blood fury detail.png|You have successfully added [number] hits to your Amulet of blood fury. It will now work for 30,000 more hits.}}
**** {{tact|end}}
*** {{topt|No, keep my Blood shard.}}
**** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|No, keep my Blood shard.}}
** {{tact|end}}

==Attempting to combine with a fully charged amulet of blood fury==
* {{mes|Your Amulet of blood fury is already at maximum capacity.}}

