===Battling another pet in the arena in the [[Menagerie]]===
* '''Bloodhound:''' {{overhead|Interesting!}}
* '''Bloodhound:''' {{overhead|I will eliminate the impossible.}}
* '''Bloodhound:''' {{overhead|Elementary!}}

