==Standard dialogue==
===Without an [[M'speak amulet]] and before completion of [[Monkey Madness II]]===
* '''Player:''' Hey, monkey!
* '''Blue Monkey:''' Eeek! Eeek! Ook!
* '''Player:''' I have no idea what you just said, but good luck with it anyway!
* {{tact|end}}
===With an [[M'speak amulet]] or after completion of [[Monkey Madness II]]===
* {{topt|cond=If the player has not taunted the monkey:|Taunt Monkey}}
** '''Player:''' Hey monkey, your mother was an inedible seaweed sandwich!
** '''Blue Monkey:''' Oh man, oh, you did not just say that!
** '''Blue Monkey:''' The second I get up that tree I am going to pelt you with bitternuts until you are neck deep in them!
** '''Player:''' Oh noes, my worst nightmare come true...
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player has taunted the monkey:|Calm Monkey}}
** '''Player:''' I'm sorry for insulting you. Is there anything I can do to make it up to you?
** '''Blue Monkey:''' Hmmmm...well, you seem sincere, how about you hurry up and use me on the tree and we'll call it even.
** '''Player:''' Yeah, ok, sounds fair.
** {{tact|end}}
* Chat Monkey
** {{tcond|If the player has taunted the monkey:}}
*** '''Player:''' Hey monkey, your mother was an inedible seaweed sandwich!
*** '''Blue Monkey:''' Oh man, oh, you did not just say that!
*** '''Blue Monkey:''' The second I get up that tree I am going to pelt you with bitternuts until you are neck deep in them!
*** '''Player:''' Oh noes, my worst nightmare come true...
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player has cautioned the monkey:}}
*** '''Player:''' Hey monkey, take your time getting the nut ok?
*** '''Blue Monkey:''' Sure. If I see any monkeys around the top of the tree I'll be careful and try and get you the nut whatever happens.
*** '''Player:''' Great!
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player has not taunted or cautioned the monkey:}}
*** '''Player:''' Hey, monkey!
*** '''Blue Monkey:''' What? Can I come out of this bag now?
*** '''Player:''' That depends, do you think you can reach those bitternuts for me?
*** '''Blue Monkey:''' Sigh...yes. Just take me to the tree and I'll grab one for you.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player has not cautioned the monkey:|Caution Monkey}}
** '''Player:''' Hey monkey, take your time getting the nut ok?
** '''Blue Monkey:''' Sure. If I see any monkeys around the top of the tree I'll be careful and try and get you the nut whatever happens.
** '''Player:''' Great!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player has cautioned the monkey:|Reassure Monkey}}
** '''Player:''' Look, never mind about taking your time, I'm sure things will be ok.
** '''Blue Monkey:''' Well if you are sure. Ok, I'll get up there and pass you the nut then.
** '''Player:''' Cheers, I'll be nearby to catch it.
** {{tact|end}}

