{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* {{topt|Give me a quest!}}
** '''Player:''' Give me a quest!
** '''Bob:''' Get yer own!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Have you anything to sell?}}
** '''Player:''' Have you anything to sell?
** '''Bob:''' Yes! I buy and sell axes! Take your pick (or axe)!
** {{tact|opens=Bob's Brilliant Axes.}}
* {{topt|Can you repair my items for me?}}
** '''Player:''' Can you repair my items for me?
** '''Bob:''' Of course I'll repair it, though the materials may cost you. Just hand me the item and I'll have a look.
** {{tact|end}}

===Right click "Repair" option===
* {{tcond|If the player has no repairable equipment:}}
** '''Bob:''' You don't have anything I can repair.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|If the player has repairable equipment:}}
** {{tselect|What would you like to do?}}
** {{topt|Repair that item: [x] coins.}}
*** {{tact|The item is repaired.}}
*** '''Bob:''' There you go, happy doing business with you!
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Cancel.}}
*** {{tact|end}}

===Left click "Use" item on Bob===
* {{tcond|If the item is repairable:}}
** {{tact|What would you like to do?}}
*** {{tact|above}}
* {{tcond|If the item is not repairable:}}
** '''Bob:''' Sorry friend, but I can't do anything with that.
** {{tact|end}}

