*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player cannot afford spare containers:}}
*** '''Bob Barter (herbs):''' You're a bit short of empty vessels or cash. Empty vials cost {{#expr:{{GEPrice|vial}}+2}} coins each and cups cost {{#expr:{{GEPrice|empty cup}}+2}} coins each.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player can only afford a few containers:}}
*** '''Bob Barter (herbs):''' There, I've done what I can, but you're a bit short of empty vessels or cash. Empty vials cost {{#expr:{{GEPrice|vial}}+2}} coins each and cups cost {{#expr:{{GEPrice|empty cup}}+2}} coins each.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player can afford all spare containers:}}
*** '''Bob Barter (herbs):''' There, all done.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
** '''Bob Barter (herbs):''' Two plus two is four, minus one that's three...
** {{tact|above}}
===4 Dose===
* '''Bob Barter (herbs):''' There, all done.
* {{tact|end}}
===Nothing Decantable===
* '''Bob Barter (herbs):''' I don't think you've got anything that I can decant.
* {{tact|end}}
===Trying to decant in free-to-play===
* '''Bob Barter (herbs):''' Sorry, mate, you'll have to come back later for that.
* {{tact|members}}

