{{Incomplete|* '''Bobawu:''' Guards! Guards! Remove this human!}}

==Without a [[greegree]] equipped==
* '''Player:''' Hello, how are you doing?
* '''Bobawu:''' I'm good thank you, how can I help you today?
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|What is this place?}}
** '''Player:''' What is this place?
** '''Bobawu:''' This is our agility course, we use it to stay nimble and to keep our wits sharp. My name is Bobawu and I look after the course.
** '''Bobawu:''' As a friend and fellow monkey, you're free to use it anytime, but you'll need to be as nimble as a ninja first!
** '''Player:''' Oh great, thank you.
** '''Player:''' Are there any rewards you can offer me?
** {{tact|below}}
* {{topt|How many laps have I done?}}
** '''Player:''' Could you tell me how many laps I've completed?
** {{tcond|If [[Monkey Madness II]] is not completed:}}
*** '''Bobawu:''' I can't offer you anything for now, so I don't see much reason to count your laps either.
*** {{tbox|You need to complete Monkey Madness 2 for Bobawu to offer rewards and to count your lap total{{sic}}}}
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If no laps have been completed:}}
*** '''Bobawu:''' Looks like you haven't completed any laps, but I'll be sure to keep track of them, when you do.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If one lap has been completed:}}
*** '''Bobawu:''' Sure thing my friend, so far you've completed 1 lap, don't stop now!
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If more than one lap has been completed:}}
*** '''Bobawu:''' Sure thing my friend, so far you've completed [number] laps, don't stop now!
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|What can you offer me?}}
** '''Player:''' What can you offer me?
** {{tcond|If [[Monkey Madness II]] is not completed:}}
*** '''Bobawu:''' I can't offer you anything for now, so I don't see much reason to count your laps either.
*** {{tbox|You need to complete Monkey Madness 2 for Bobawu to offer rewards and to count your lap total{{sic}}}}
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If [[Monkey Madness II]] is completed:}}
*** '''Bobawu:''' I see you have your own monkey friend, by completing laps here you can transform him into different monkeys!
*** '''Player:''' That's neat, what can he turn into?
*** '''Bobawu:''' I've got the list here!
*** {{tbox|Bobawu pulls out a tattered piece of paper from his ninja costume.}}
*** '''Bobawu:''' Ahem, here we are, At 100 you'll unlock a Karamjan Monkey transformation.
*** '''Bobawu:''' After completing 250 laps, you'll unlock a scary zombie monkey.
*** '''Bobawu:''' With 500 laps finished, you'll get a maniacal monkey.
*** '''Bobawu:''' At 1000 laps, you'll be able transform him into a spooky skeleton monkey,
*** '''Bobawu:''' 1500 laps for a little Kruk Jr monkey,
*** '''Bobawu:''' Finally at 2000 laps, he can transform to look like our King Awowogei.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Never mind.}}
** '''Player:''' On second thought, never mind.
** '''Bobawu:''' That's okay my friend, come back anytime.
** {{tact|end}}

==With a [[greegree]] equipped==
* '''Player:''' Hey there, how do you do my fellow monkey?
* '''Bobawu:''' I'm good thank you, how can I help you today?
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
